{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n -C 12 'D191|共同量|问题怎么写|industry_aggregate|schema_for|v74i' docs/DECISIONS-log.md docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html src/hivemind/extraction.py\"","aggregated_output":"src/hivemind/extraction.py-1-\"\"\"Extraction (docs/prd/05-extraction.md): the whole item goes to the model with its category's prompt, the questions open at the\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-2-start of the item's day (each with its takes line) and the filing rule beside the links field; the answer is evidence filed under those\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-3-questions or under this answer's candidate questions, and candidates written in full. Code checks the sources (the quote is in the\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-4-text, every link points at a shown question or a kept candidate), the ladders (five rungs or two) and the rule that quarterly numbers\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-5-are evidence, not questions; a statement filed nowhere is dropped as 'no home' (D209).\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-6-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py:7:The request is the frozen production prompt, extraction v74i (D274). No other version is built: a configuration that names another\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-8-is refused before any call, and a new version is a new decision with its own code. Every answer is read in the canonical vocabulary.\"\"\"\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-9-import dataclasses\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-10-import datetime\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-11-import difflib\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-12-import json\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-13-import re\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-14-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-15-from . import config, model, placement, vocabulary\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-16-from .universe import parse_year\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-17-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-18-TIERS = vocabulary.TIERS\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-19-MAX_TEXT_CHARS = 400_000\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py:20:SUPPORTED_VERSIONS = ('v74i',)    # D274: the frozen production prompt\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-21-# D184: the closed set of reasons a candidate question may open; anything else is evidence to a shown question\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py:22:ADMISSION_REASONS = ['main_driver', 'industry_aggregate', 'policy_stage', 'binding_obligation']\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-23-BINDING_HORIZON_DAYS = 548        # D185: a binding obligation is due within 18 months of the item, and is exempt from the next-year rule on quantities\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-24-# The three attribution fields carry their definitions in the schema, beside the field they govern (standard 5.4: the original\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-25-# claimant; an unknown statement day is unknown, never the report day; D220, D203; 5.5: relays of one report are one source)\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-26-FIELD_NOTES = {\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-27-    'speaker': 'Who says it in this item: the outlet, the author or the person quoted.',\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-28-    'original_who': ('The party whose statement, figure or action it is, even when the item reports it without attribution (\"the insurer agreed '\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-29-                     'to buy the broker\": the insurer; \"the regulator fined the bank, a newspaper reported\": the regulator); the outlet or author '\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-30-                     'only for its own estimate, analysis or unnamed-source report.'),\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-31-    'original_day': ('The day that party made it, as an ISO day when the item gives one (\"signed on 3 March 2026\": 2026-03-03); empty when the '\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-32-                     \"item gives none or only a month; the publication day only when the item is that party's own release, filing, call or analysis.\"),\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-33-}\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-34-\n--\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-150-    schema['required'].append('new_groups')\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-151-    return schema\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-152-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-153-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-154-def with_field_notes(schema, notes):\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-155-    \"\"\"The schema with the notes as the descriptions of the evidence fields they name.\"\"\"\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-156-    fields = schema['properties']['evidence']['items']['properties']\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-157-    for name, note in notes.items():\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-158-        fields[name] = dict(fields[name], description=note)\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-159-    return schema\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-160-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-161-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py:162:def schema_for(version, shown_view_ids=()):\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-163-    \"\"\"The answer's schema: the grouped schema, the admission fields (D184: the reason a candidate opens and the material that settles\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-164-    it), the attribution fields' definitions and the filing rule beside the links field (D256, D274). The request shows its questions\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-165-    in the text and names none in the schema, so shown_view_ids does not change it.\"\"\"\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-166-    require_supported(version)\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-167-    schema = grouped_schema()\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-168-    candidate = schema['properties']['candidates']['items']\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-169-    candidate['properties'].update({'opens_as': {'type': 'string', 'enum': list(ADMISSION_REASONS)}, 'settled_by': {'type': 'string'}})\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-170-    candidate['required'] += ['opens_as', 'settled_by']\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-171-    return with_field_notes(schema, dict(FIELD_NOTES, links=placement.FILING_RULE_ROOT_FALLBACK))\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-172-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-173-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-174-@dataclasses.dataclass\n--\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-433-# 06-views ladder rule 6: a quarterly or half-year figure is evidence, not a view. The half-year forms name a revenue\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-434-# or sales figure (H1 收入, first-half revenue); an event scheduled in a half-year (ships in H2 2026) is not a figure.\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-435-QUARTERLY = re.compile(r'(\\bQ[1-4]\\b|第[一二三四1-4]季|季度|\\bquarter(?!ly report)|fiscal Q[1-4]|\\b(?:[12]H|H[12])\\b(?:\\s+(?:FY)?\\d{4})?\\s*收入|上半年收入|下半年收入'\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-436-                       r'|\\b(?:[12]H|H[12])\\b(?:\\s+(?:FY)?\\d{4})?\\s+(?:revenue|sales|net sales)|\\b(?:first|second)[- ]half(?:[- ]year)?\\s+(?:revenue|sales|net sales)'\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-437-                       r'|\\bhalf[- ]year\\s+(?:revenue|sales|net sales))', re.I)\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-438-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-439-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-440-def request_for(cfg, item, text, shown_views, universe):\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-441-    \"\"\"Build the setting, complete prompt and schema without making a call.\"\"\"\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-442-    setting = cfg.extraction_setting(item['category'])\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-443-    version = setting.prompt_version.rpartition('-')[2]\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-444-    system, user = build_prompt(item, text, shown_views, universe, version)\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py:445:    return setting, system, user, schema_for(version)\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-446-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-447-\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-448-@dataclasses.dataclass\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-449-class Reading:\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-450-    \"\"\"An item read: the extraction answer through the code checks, before the handover (the parallel day prepares it early and\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-451-    files it at the item's turn).\"\"\"\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-452-    evidence: list\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-453-    candidates: list\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-454-    dropped: list\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-455-    new_groups: list\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-456-    answer: object\nsrc/hivemind/extraction.py-457-    version: str\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2455-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2456-## D183 · 2026-10-26 · The replay runs the parallel day by default\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2457-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2458-- Alex, after the comparison of the two modes (same ledger for the same answers; about 4× faster on a busy day of fresh calls; about 24% more cost; a rerun on saved answers free and fastest serially): \"没事我们先都跑parallel, 这样可以快速的收敛。\" This replaces D182's lean.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2459-- `scripts/replay.py` now runs each day with `hivemind.parallel_day` unless told otherwise: `--workers` defaults to 16, `--jev-workers` to 8 when the configuration matches with Jev and to 1 for another matching engine (the parallel day refuses parallel matching outside Jev). `--workers 1` runs the serial path; it is needed to resume a day a serial run left unfinished, which the parallel day refuses without its manifest. Worker counts stay run arguments, not Config (D3); `replay.run` itself keeps `day_runner=None` as its serial path.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2460-- Cost of the default, as measured: early requests a later commit changes are paid and discarded (+24% a busy day live), and a rerun on saved answers sends the early requests its archive lacks (0–8 on July 27) and takes about a second longer.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2461-- Test: the entry point with its defaults runs the parallel day and writes the serial ledger; with `--workers 1` it runs serially (a mutant that asks a non-Jev matcher eight questions at a time is caught).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2462-- Code review before the push ([request](research/2026-10-26-e2e-parallel/review-2-request.txt), [Codex, read-only](research/2026-10-26-e2e-parallel/review-2.txt); no correctness defect in request identity, commit order, matching order or thread ownership). Fixed, each with a test that failed first: (1) a restart under `--max-items-per-day` counted only the remaining items, so it dispatched an item beyond the day's limit (serial) or was refused by the manifest (parallel); the items an earlier run of the day wrote now count toward the limit. (2) The study and test comparison read 12 of the ledger's 20 tables; one comparison (`proof.ledger_rows`) now reads every product table without row ids, call ids and wall-clock times, and recomparing every stored pair found them identical (D180's recorded day, the 16-worker recorded run, the product-entry live run, the six D181 cross-replays, D182's fifteen days: 5,805 rows), the D182 mutant differing in 16 tables. (3) The entry point is tested with no arguments on the default Jev configuration (16 and 8 workers, serial ledger; a mutant default is caught). (4) A stale sentence in the current state. Found by Claude: a manifest left by another ledger in the same folder refused a fresh ledger that had written nothing of that day; such a manifest is now replaced, and a ledger that has written part of the day still refuses a changed contract.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2463-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2464-## D184 · 2026-10-26 · A candidate thesis opens for one of four reasons, stated in the answer\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2465-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2466-- After the granularity research ([report](../reports/对冲基金论点粒度与金标.md); four notes in `research_notes/对冲基金论点粒度与金标/`): the ledger's 90 theses hold 25–32 at analyst granularity by two independent readings; the rest are financial lines, duplicates of one aggregate, customer deployments or unsettleable questions. The mechanism is one: the extractor's unit was \"a sentence with a number and a period\", not a disagreement; matching then rightly judged nine populations of one aggregate as nine quantities. Alex, on the clean version of option B (prompt plus schema-enforced fields, no dedup key): \"可以\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2467:- Decided: from extraction version 12 the default output for a statement is evidence to a shown thesis. A candidate opens only for one of four reasons, a closed schema enum `opens_as`: `main_driver` (an annual quantity that carries the company's value, whether or not the company guides it; first named `guidance_on_main_driver`, which the seed run showed excludes NVIDIA's data-center revenue because NVIDIA guides only quarterly), `industry_aggregate` (one aggregate quantity per calendar year; a later estimate or another population of it is evidence), `policy_stage` (a stage of a policy process with its authority named), `binding_obligation` (a guarantee, financing, equity stake or purchase commitment a universe company takes on). Every candidate also carries `settled_by` (the public material that resolves it), `folds_into` (the shown thesis it would otherwise attach to, or empty; the schema pattern is built from the shown ids) and `lost_if_folded` (the investment implication lost if it only attached there). Code checks shape (`extraction.check_admission`): blank text, an unshown `folds_into` and a binding obligation beyond its horizon are refused; the judgement of importance stays with the model (D154/D155). No key rule is added (log row 43 stands). Versions ≤ 11 are unchanged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2468-- The prompt `role-v12` replaces v11's \"which questions to propose\" with the four reasons and the three fields (7,357 characters / 1,482 o200k tokens against v11's 6,567 / 1,312: growth of 790 characters, the definitions of the three required fields and the four reasons; the recipe lines were already removed in v11, and the user message is unchanged). Configuration `poc-v25` = `poc-v23` with every category on v12. Measured against the extraction gold (D188) on the seed, week and August windows; results in `poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/`.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2469-- Closes the open question \"thesis granularity\" of 05-extraction and 06-views: the research synthesis's \"split when settled by different prints\" and \"2–4 per name\" are not rules; the eight labeller rules of the report §1 are the standard, and a count is an outcome.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2470-- Result ([results](../poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/results.md)): two false starts diagnosed on stored data ($0.08 together: a check that demanded a reason not to fold when there was nothing to fold into; reason 1 named as guidance, which excluded NVIDIA's data-center revenue), then one run over seed, week and August ($1.31 against the baseline's $1.01, the three fields and re-prepared requests). Theses 90 → 60, financial-line theses 29 → 3, evidence 534 → 710; gold full 3 → 9, partial 7 → 0, fail 10 → 11, every v12 failure a miss and none an extra. Remaining, counted: six theses for one 2026 aggregate, about seven small binding obligations, three proceedings opened as policy stages; eight candidates named a thesis in `folds_into` and opened anyway, six of them duplicates. A read-only code review's two wording findings on the role (a milestone on the main product under `main_driver`; the D185 exception beside the year limit) go to a v13 arm with the rule-2 wording for obligations and policy stages, Alex's call. Branch `feat/thesis-admission-v12`, not merged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2471-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2472-## D185 · 2026-10-26 · A binding obligation is due within 18 months and is exempt from the next-year rule\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2473-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2474-- Alex chose option B (\"可以\"): the current/next-year window keeps bounding quantities; a thesis on a binding obligation a universe company takes on (guarantee, financing, equity, purchase commitment) may set its own check day up to 18 months after the item (`extraction.BINDING_HORIZON_DAYS = 548`), because the signing can be checked long before the project it finances is built (Ohio: the guarantee in 2026, the campus in 2028). Due with no reliable material: \"no data to verify\", never a pass or a fail (AGENTS §8). Amends 06-views ladder rule 5 for this reason only.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2475-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2476-## D186 · 2026-10-26 · Asset-thesis rungs describe business outcomes; the favourable end is registered per thesis\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2477-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2478-- Alex chose option C (\"可以\"): rungs of an asset thesis state the business outcome (above, near or below guidance), and each thesis registers which end is favourable for the company, as a theme thesis's dependants already state a direction. Reason: results and direction separate (NVDA beat four quarters and fell; capital spending can build capacity or hurt returns). Recorded; not implemented in this slice: it changes `check_ladder`, the writer, judging, the UI adapter and the Idea route (value × reader), so it is its own slice with its own measurement.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2479-\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2491-- The [trace review](research/2026-10-26-thesis-admission-v12/trace-review.md) reads every thesis, every gold failure and the duplicate aggregates to their raw requests, answers and matching decisions, and names the root causes by design layer: thesis identity is a quantity where the analyst's unit is a question (six 2026 aggregates, each judged \"new\" correctly under the current criterion); the contract under-produces on first contact with a company (AMD 2 theses, MSFT 0); the role states categories where the labeller applies tests; theme candidates name no dependant; the extractor never sees the current view. Six general mechanisms are proposed with the class and count each moves, in the order: matching's \"another estimate or population of the same question\" option and theme dependants (code and schema, no prompt growth), then role v13 (tests instead of lists, the first-contact rule, quarterly statements as evidence; net shorter), then showing the view in block 5 as an A/B, then the daily duplicate check as pull-mode design. Each is Alex's call; none is built here.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2492-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2493-## D190 · 2026-10-26 · The collision judge: Jev for identity, the generative model for the analyst's question when a question may be held twice\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2494-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2495-- Alex: \"查重是用的 Jev 吗？… 你可以先单独跑这个，重新 review 一次 Jev 的提示词，然后优化他，不仅达到你的目的，也更贴近 hedge fund analyst 的大脑，你有黄金集做标准\". Jev answers every candidate-to-thesis relation and every evidence comparison since D169.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2496-- Review of Jev's relation criteria against the r3 ledger ([probe](../poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/jev-relation-probe/probe.md), 31 stored candidate calls whose list holds a thesis of the same object and measure, 18 labelled by the assistant): under the current options Jev calls a population variant of one aggregate `part_of` (0.4–0.9) and the code maps that to \"new\"; under an analyst's option set (\"one question: the same outcome settles both; another estimate, population or proxy of one aggregate is the same question\") it answers `distinct_question_same_matter` 0.5–0.9 on the same pairs. Both wordings: 8 of 18 right. Jev compares wording; it does not hold the decision. No change to Jev's criteria is made: the measured criteria stay (D167–D169).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2497-- The generative model asked the same analyst question on the same 18 ([records](../poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/jev-relation-probe/llm-records.json), 3 samples each, $0.02): 11 of 18 right by majority, and 5 of the 6 aggregate duplicates merged; the misses are the debatable pairs (a reporting segment beside the business segment, the same deal under two names).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2498-- Decided to build and run alone: `matching` keeps Jev; a configuration may add a `collision` setting (model, prompt `collision-v1`). When a candidate's list holds a thesis of its own object and measure, one generative call answers the analyst question for those theses and its verdict replaces Jev's on them (`jev_matching.collision_peers`, `ask_collision_judge`); every other relation stays Jev's. `poc-v26` = `poc-v25` plus the judge. Measured by one run over seed, week and August against the extraction gold and the census (ledger `english-v26-collision-r4-2026-10-26`); result appended here.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2499-- General, not a list: the routing rule is a structural fact of the library (two theses of one object and quantity), and the question is the one a desk asks. The cost is one call per collision (31 of 69 candidates on r3), about $0.002 each.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2500-- Result (run r4, `poc-v26`, seed + week + August, $1.33): 26 collision verdicts, 9 merges or successions, all on aggregate variants; 2026 aggregate theses 6 → 2 (v23: 11); theses 60 → 45; no merge removed a thesis the gold wants and A17 (the four-company figure as evidence to the five-company aggregate) turns full. The gold's overall score moved 9 → 4 full, and every lost case is an extraction difference between two fresh runs of the same v12 prompt (Rubin not opened from the call this time, the NAVER and META lines not extracted), not a matching decision. Recorded as the measurement rule for later arms: a matching change is judged on stored candidates and the duplicate census; an extraction change needs three fresh runs or pinned extraction answers; a one-run gold score carries about ±5 cases of sampler noise on this corpus. `poc-v25` stays the replay default until the judge is measured that way.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2501-- Confirmation with extraction pinned (same recorded extraction answers in both arms, ids translated, Jev live, judging synthetic; `pinned_matching_study.py`): control reproduces r3 (60 theses, gold 9 full); the judge arm 56 theses, 2026 aggregates 6 → 3, evidence equal (711 vs 707 rows), gold 8 full with the one difference a repeat the scorer cannot see; 31 verdicts, 6 merges, $0.011; no required thesis lost. Alex: \"有效果我们可以做\". `poc-v26` becomes the replay default; `poc-v25` stays as a configuration. Open: the judge leaves 2 of 5 aggregate duplicates apart on one sample; a majority of three samples on collisions would cost three cents a run.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2502-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2503:## D191 · 2026-10-26 · Theme theses reach every company; no named dependant is required to open one\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2504-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2505-- On the theme-dependency design (`docs/research/2026-10-26-theme-dependencies/design.md`), Alex decided the four points:\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2506-  1. A theme candidate does **not** have to name the company thesis it feeds. Alex: \"我觉得这个非常难，有时候一个政策影响非常的广，你这种做法基本不可行，不可能所有的公司都 map 到，你可以默认这些宏观的东西和所有公司都有影响，我觉得这个 1 to all mapping 比较 make sense，至于这个 thesis 的 state 对每个不同公司的影响需要别的方法来判断\". Decided: a theme thesis is context for every company thesis (one to all); how its state bears on each company is decided when that company's thesis is judged, not by an edge written at extraction. Explicit dependencies stay for the cases a document states (a company thesis on another thesis), and may be added to an existing thesis later (point 2).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2507-  2. A dependency may be added to an existing thesis by a later item (\"可以\").\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2508-  3. From a macro-only item, a theme opens only when the theme is in the universe's list (\"是\"); an unlisted theme waits for a company item.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2509:  4. `industry_aggregate` is renamed `shared_quantity`: a quantity or price outside any one company that several move on (\"好\").\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2510-- Consequences for the design, to be worked before any build: the judge of a company thesis reads the current state and reasons of the open theme theses of the themes its items were tagged with (block of the judging request), and states the sign it applies; a changed theme conclusion does not fan out to every company thesis in the same round (06-views: a repeated Fed statement must not trigger hundreds), it is read at each thesis's next judgement; proceedings that move no line are kept out by the admission test on themes (the model's judgement), not by a missing edge. The `feeds` field of the design is withdrawn for themes.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2511-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2512-## D192 · 2026-10-26 · Role v13 (tests instead of lists) fails its probe; wording is exhausted as a lever\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2513-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2514-- Alex: \"接着做下一步，不要 scope creep, just solve the core problems on improving quality for the extraction\". Role v13 replaced the four category definitions and the ban list by the labeller's three tests (swing, independence, loss), added the first-contact rule (two to four questions for a company with no thesis shown) and named quarterly or run-rate statements as evidence; 7,580 characters against v12's 7,458.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2515-- Probe ([role_probe.py](research/2026-10-26-thesis-admission-v12/role_probe.py), `poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/role-probe/`): the gold's 20 items re-sent with the stored v12 request's user message and v13's system prompt and schema, three samples each, sifted and scored at the candidate level against the gold's must-open and must-not-open keys; the stored v12 answers of two runs (r3, r4) are the controls. Must-open keys proposed: v12 9/15 and 8/15, v13 26/45 (8.7 per sample); must-not-open keys proposed: v12 0 and 1, v13 11/174 (3.7 per sample: a tax-rate thesis from the press release in two samples, a Taiwan proceeding in two, a run-rate thesis); candidates 30, 30, 33 per sample. $0.09.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2516-- Read: the tests moved two cases the right way (the Helios milestone 3/3 against 1/3; the Ohio guarantee 2/3 against 0/2) and others the wrong way (the press release and the proceeding); coverage did not rise. The consistent misses (a numeric China-revenue thesis 0/5, Microsoft's capex 1/5, AMD's data-center FY2026 line) are judgements the model makes the same way under both wordings, not a reading of a list. Not adopted; `poc-v27` stays a configuration.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2517:- A narrower v14 (role-v12 plus only the milestone clause the Helios gain came from, the D191 rename and the D185 exception, minus the peripherals sentence) is probed the same way; result appended here. Result: worse than v12 in the other direction: must-open keys proposed 14/45 (4.7 per sample against 9 and 8), candidates 17 per sample against 30; the February 25 call opened neither data-center revenue nor gross margin in any of three samples (two candidates each), while Helios rose to 2/3 and Ohio to 1/3. Twenty-five characters of wording moved coverage by half. Not adopted; `poc-v28` stays a configuration.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2518-- Decided: role v12 stays. Two audited wordings moved the extractor in opposite directions on the same items; the extractor's behaviour is more sensitive to wording than to meaning, and a single sample at temperature 0.2 is the unit being measured. The levers that remain are structural, each Alex's call: (1) show the current view in block 5 so the swing test has an input; (2) sample the extraction three times and keep the candidates a majority proposes (identity by typed key), which turns the variance into a vote at three times the extraction cost (about +$1.7 over this window); (3) the first-contact pass as its own call on a company's first item. None is built here.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2519- Beyond that, the remaining lever for extraction is not wording: the extractor never sees the current view (05-extraction block 5 shows question, focus and due date only), which is the input the swing test needs (trace review §5).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2520-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2521-## D193 · 2026-10-26 · Extraction coverage is at the model's steady state; the phase closes on v12 with the collision judge\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2522-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2523-- Alex: \"太贵了抽 N 次 … 其他的点你自己深度思考啊 … 你深度的研究思考小范围尝试，给我结果让我清晰的做决策\". Sampling several times per item is ruled out on cost.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2524-- Two structural arms probed on the gold's 20 items with the stored v12 user messages, three samples each ($0.22): extraction at `reasoning_effort: medium` (configuration only) and block 5 carrying each shown thesis's current rung and last reasons. Neither moves coverage: 8.3 of 15 must-open keys per sample against 9 and 8 for the two stored v12 runs; medium reasoning proposes fewer candidates (25 against 30) at 1.8× the time; the view block adds a little clutter (1.7 against 0–1). With D192's v13 and v14, five arms give the same picture: the gold's must-open coverage is the model's steady state on these texts, about 8–9 of 15, and the six misses are the same judgements under every arm.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2525:- Decided: extraction stays on v12 with the collision judge (`poc-v26`, D190). No further extraction arm is run without new information: a human pass on the six persistent misses (three of which the gold could accept as alternatives) decides whether they are the gold's or the model's; the next build is the D191 theme block in judging. Recorded probes: `poc/reports/2026-10-26-admission-v12/role-probe/`.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2526-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2527-## D194 · 2026-10-26 · The six persistent misses read against the transcripts: one gold key removed, five stand\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2528-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2529-- Alex: \"你自己看完是怎么归类评价的\" … \"好那你既然有判断了，那来改吧\". The pass D193 left open was done by the assistant against the source texts and the stored candidates of every v12 run (r1–r4), not by a second labeller.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2530-- The yardstick: does the text give a number or a date an analyst would track to a due day, and did the model open the same decision through another admission reason. Read that way:\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2531-  - **AMD data-center FY2026 (A14): the gold's.** The call gives no full-year 2026 data-center figure (only the Q3 guide, \"server revenue more than 80% in the second half\" and \"data-center revenue more than double in 2027\"); the model opens the 2027 line in every run. The key came from v23's `v53`, not from the transcript. Removed; the gold's must-open keys go from 15 to 14; resealed.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2532-  - **NVDA China (A03): the model's, by authority, not by granularity.** The policy reading is already an accepted alternative, but every policy candidate the model wrote (\"will the U.S. government allow H200 imports into China\", r1 and r4) names the U.S. as the authority the text leaves open (\"we do not know whether any imports will be allowed into China\" after \"approved by the U.S. government\"). The gold's rule that the China key cannot match a U.S.-licence thesis stands; in r2 and r3 the model opened nothing on China.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2533-  - **MSFT calendar-2026 capex (A13): the gold stands.** The call states the figure. The model links it as evidence to the five-company aggregate (r3) or opens FY2027 capex (r4); both are defensible, but a Microsoft page without its own capex question is the wrong product. Kept as must-open with the fiscal-year alternative.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2534-  - **Helios first shipments (A14), Intelligent Cloud FY2027 (A13), CoreWeave FY2026 revenue (A12): the model's.** Each is a stated number or date (\"initial shipments on track to begin later this quarter\"; Intelligent Cloud guided to $40.95–41.25bn, Azure +45%; revenue guidance raised to $12.4–13.2bn). The three share one shape: the first call of a company in the window, where the model opened one or two theses and stopped. That is the first-contact pattern v13 tried (D192: +0.7 must-open, +3.7 must-not-open), so it is a known limit of v12, recorded here, not an open arm.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2535-- Scores do not move: every reported ledger scores the same against the corrected gold (v23 3 full / 7 partial / 10 fail; r3 9/0/11; r4 4/0/16; pinned control 9/0/11, pinned arm 8/0/12), because A14 still fails on Helios. The probes' per-sample coverage in D192/D193 was counted on the 15-key gold; the removed key was proposed by no stored run, so the readings there are 8–9 of 14.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2536:- Decided: the gold is corrected as above and stays assistant-labelled (D188's two-labeller pass remains Alex's); extraction stays closed on v12 with the collision judge (D193); the next build is the D191 theme block in judging.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2537-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2538-## D195 · 2026-10-26 · The theme block: every asset thesis is judged with the open theme theses in view, and a changed theme conclusion reaches them in the same round\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2539-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2540-- Alex: \"做，先零成本数完再改；然后你得确认这个架构和逻辑是对的\", then on the one open choice \"A 但是仔细思考怎么做才是正确的\". Census and design: `docs/research/2026-10-26-theme-dependencies/design.md` §8 (`theme_block_census.py`; Codex read-only review, 12 findings, each read against the code, §8.8).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2541-- What the ledgers said ($0): every company judgement would carry a block (175 of 175 in r4, 2–6 theme lines); the narrow reading by item tags shows a block in 14 of 175, so Alex's one-to-all rule is the only one with data; in 9 judgements the theme was judged after the company thesis in the same round; without propagation 109 of 228 theme changes are never read inside the window; with it, 141 more judgement calls, about $0.24 on the window.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2542-- Decided (A): under `judging-v4` (`poc-v29`) an asset thesis's request carries `[Themes in force]`: every open theme thesis with a current state, its rung, the reasons of its last judgement and whether it changed since this thesis was last judged; the answer carries `theme_pushes` (view id, push in the evidence-push vocabulary), checked by code against the block and stored as `judgements.theme_pushes_json`, served as `theme_pushes`. Theme theses are judged before asset theses in a round; a theme judgement that says changed queues every open asset thesis with evidence in force, once per round, the rule explicit dependants follow (`changed` is the PRD's filter: a repeat does not fire it, a facts-only change does). The round's queue is derived from the ledger (the day's changed views, the dependants of views judged at this sequence number with a changed conclusion, the asset theses a changed theme queued), which also closes a hole the review found: a round interrupted after some judgements committed lost what they had queued. Everything is gated on the prompt version; v3 ledgers replay unchanged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2543:- This replaces the consequence note under D191 (\"a changed theme conclusion does not fan out to every company thesis in the same round\"): that sentence was the assistant's, and the census priced both sides. Explicit dependencies, D191 point 2 and the UI are unchanged. A theme conclusion is never evidence (06-views) and is never cited in `cites`.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2544-- Three r4 asset theses re-judged once under v4 ($0.009, `poc/reports/2026-10-26-theme-block/resend-three.txt`): the signs read as an analyst would give them (hyperscaler capex toward the bullish end for NVIDIA data-center revenue, AMD data-center growth and TSMC revenue; the H200 permission toward it for NVIDIA; the overseas-computing restriction away; a tungsten-scrap allocation ignored by all three). One replay of the window under `poc-v29` (r5) measures it beside r4; adoption as the replay default waits for that measurement.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2545-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2546-## D196 · 2026-10-27 · `poc-v29` (the theme block) is the replay default\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2547-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2548-- Measured once over the r4 window (`poc/reports/2026-10-26-theme-block/results.md`): 245 asset judgements carried the block, 194 named a theme push with signs that follow each thesis's own ladder; propagation added 121 judgements (+$0.20) and changed a conclusion one time in ten; reasons read the same or better on the five theses with the same question in both ledgers; one judge call in 307 ran out of output on the largest thesis and answered on resume. The whole run cost $1.46 against $1.21 with cached input at its published rate ($1.59 against $1.33 with every input token at the input rate; the cost column priced cached input at the full rate until 2026-10-27, build-log row 57).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2549-- Decided: `scripts/replay.py` defaults to `poc/config/poc-v29.json`; `poc-v26` stays as the control configuration. Not built: the block on the UI; a tighter aggregate-theme identity (the near-duplicate aggregates each take a line in every block).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2550-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2551-## D197 · 2026-10-27 · A shared quantity is one thesis per theme, measure and period; its wording is not identity\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2552-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2553-- Alex: \"先把合计资本开支的重复主题题解决掉; 你小范围验证就好这个问题不要全部重跑，你能不能快速收敛\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2554:- The class ($0, `docs/research/2026-10-27-shared-quantity/proof.py`): every AI-capex aggregate candidate of r3, r4 and r5 (9, 11, 11) against the theses that existed before it. r3 (no collision judge) opened six 2026 aggregates; r4 and r5, with the judge, each opened one duplicate: the judge read \"Big Tech AI outlays\" against \"the top five's total capex\" (r4 seq 351) and \"the five named companies' capex\" against \"industrywide AI infrastructure spending\" (r5 seq 200) as distinct questions in one matter, and later candidates then merged into the duplicate (r4: two). The contract already says what identity is: `industry_aggregate` is \"one aggregate quantity for one calendar year … another population or another wording of the same aggregate is evidence to the shown aggregate thesis\" (role-v12), and D155 puts identity in code where it is fully determined.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:2555:- Decided: a candidate admitted as `industry_aggregate` / `shared_quantity` with a quantity measure is keyed by (theme, measure, period) with no scope (`identity.automatic_key`); the writer records its key with `scope_source = 'shared'`; on the Jev path code decides its destination before any judge (`jev_matching.shared_quantity_target`): the open thesis of the same key is the same thesis (merge), the latest earlier period without a successor is its predecessor (succession), otherwise new. Policy stages and other events keep their event-typed identity; a company's own line (MSFT capex) is another object and never the aggregate; a theme quantity without the admission reason (the pre-D184 financing-amount case of T4) stays the model's. Tests: `tests/test_shared_quantity.py` (3, red first), suite 187.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2556-- Proof on stored data: the rule flips every duplicate to a merge (r3: 5 merges + 1 succession; r4: 1; r5: 1), touches no other object, and changes no stored matching check (preflight C: 618 judged, 9 refused, as before). Small-scale validation (Alex: no full rerun): the r5 window replayed with extraction pinned to r5's answers and matching live (`docs/research/2026-10-27-shared-quantity/pinned_arm.py`, `poc/data/pinned-shared-2026-10-27/`): one 2026 aggregate thesis (v22, 33 evidence links; r5 had two theses with 40 links between them) and one 2027 successor (v29, succeeding v22); the rule decided 10 aggregate candidates (8 merges, 1 succession, 1 opened), the collision judge was asked 17 times about other peers, cost $0.21 (Jev) + $0.01 (judge).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2557-- Codex read-only review of the branch's code (D195–D197, `scratchpad codex-code-review-d195-d197.out.md`), seven findings, each fixed with a failing test first: an unknown measure (`other`) is never a shared identity; two wordings of the next year's aggregate in one answer are one successor (coalesced by key, not refused as a second successor); a shared candidate's comparison list holds every thesis of its theme and measure, so a predecessor outside the search window is a valid target; the judgement's theme ids are checked against the block the request carried, not the ledger's state at check time; Jev is not asked a relation question about a shared candidate; a ledger written before the theme block gains the column at the write boundary (test that fails without the migration); one propagation rule (`queued_by_change`) serves live and resumed rounds. Suite 192.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2558-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2559-## D198 · 2026-10-27 · A judgement reads the evidence in view, not everything in force\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2560-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2561-- Alex, 2026-10-27, on the finding that evidence in force grows without bound (v6, NVIDIA FY2027 Data Center revenue: 574 pieces after six weeks, 415 never cited by any of its 33 judgements; 40 of 316 judge requests over 30k tokens, max 67k; judging 38% of spend and rising; the run's stall came from enumerating 300+ ids): \"这是什么问题你深度思考之后改\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2562-- What the problem is (design: `docs/research/2026-10-27-evidence-in-view/design.md`): two mechanisms. (1) Extraction links wide: `role-v14.txt` says \"every statement and number is, by default, evidence linked to a shown thesis\" and also \"link only to the thesis it directly concerns; omit statements with no thesis\"; the model attaches every business mention to the broadest thesis (2.5 pieces per item on v6; a liquid-cooling note, a SuperPOD purchase, a rack R&D story). Not changed here; the prompt audit is reported to Alex as the next slice. (2) Judging-v4 reads everything in force every time (\"Rejudge from all evidence currently in force\"); an analyst keeps what his view rests on and reads what arrived.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2563-- Decided: from judging-v5 (`poc-v30`) a judgement of a thesis is shown, of its evidence in force, the arrivals (pieces linked after the thesis's fifth most recent judgement, READINGS = 5; everything when it has fewer) and the basis (pieces cited by one of its last ten judgements, BASIS = 10). The rest stays in force in the ledger; the request names the count (\"[Not shown: N more pieces in force, read in earlier judgements; the previous conclusion carries them]\"); the answer may cite and push only shown ids, checked against the request that was sent (`judging.evidence_shown_in`, as the theme block is). Nothing leaves the ledger; the repeat / replace / new rules, \"in force\", the rejudgement triggers, eligibility, the theme block and dependencies are unchanged. Gated on the prompt version: v4 ledgers and configurations read in force as before.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2564-- Measured ($0, `census.py`, two ledgers): among judgements after a thesis's first, the rule would have hidden 1.5% (nvda-3m) and 1.1% (r5) of the citations the judge actually made (22 of 325 and 7 of 261 judgements lose one cite, mostly third-party risk mentions listed in a \"pull the other way\" sentence); shown mean 95 and 109 pieces where in force averaged 225 and 178. Tighter rules hid 16% (cited last time + new since) or kept growing (ever cited + three readings). Arm beside control (`ab.py`, $0.03): v6, v11, v22 from the same ledger state, v4 fresh against v5: the same rung and `changed` on all three, reasons consistent, request tokens 76,476 → 12,516, 53,151 → 11,204, 25,806 → 8,425. Tests: `tests/test_evidence_in_view.py` (4, red first); suite 199.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2565-- Applied to the three-month run at a day boundary: 2026-08-18 finished under `poc-v29` on the serial path (the parallel runner refuses a half-done day after a code change), `poc-v30` from 2026-08-19. Prompt `judging-v5` is `judging-v4` with the first rule reworded (2,264 → 2,437 characters; the growth is the sentence that says what is not shown and who carries it).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2566-- Also in this slice, from the stall at 2026-08-07: a code-refused judgement answer is retired from the archive's lookup (`model.Archive.retire`; the row stays; schema-refused and malformed rows already carried a suffix), so a resume re-samples instead of replaying the refused answer; and the request's closing line names a closed set that exists (\"cites_views must be empty: this thesis depends on no other thesis\"; \"a theme id goes only in theme_pushes, never in cites or cites_views\"): 4 of the run's 5 retried first answers had put theme ids into cites_views.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-2567-\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3041-## D259 · 2026-11-02 · The takes line takes the evidence that bears on a question's answer, not only its own figures: D254's \"direct drivers stated with a size\" gate goes; supporting evidence gets its leeway\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3042-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3043-- Alex, 2026-11-02 morning, asked what to do with the supporting evidence the standard keeps but no question takes (74 gold supporting matters a draw dropped at placement, 88% with no bet under the library and the takes lines; the three options put to him were drop and tighten the standard, a company file outside the judgement, or widen the takes line at the cost of the revenue sinks): \"先放款take 吧，辅助反正就是个中间地带我们给点leeway\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3044-- Mechanism (arm 3's 51 supporting matters dropped in every draw read one by one, `research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/supporting-dropped-read-r3.txt`; one placement request read as the model reads it, `review-2026-11-02.md` §7): the figure question's takes line ended \"and the direct drivers of that figure stated with a size\", and the event and policy lines named only the event's own steps. The size gate contradicted the same request's system prompt (\"even when it gives no period, basis or exact amount\") and D240, and \"direct drivers\" excluded what the standard files as supporting: another company's operating figures (§6), a named customer's, supplier's or competitor's action (§5.1 item 2), anything reached through D250 item 2's path test. Half the dropped class is named partner, customer and competitor actions without an amount (Palantir's Nemotron integration, DeepSeek's chip, SambaNova's round, JPMorgan choosing SambaNova), a fifth is other companies' numbers (Broadcom's AI revenue guide, Micron's margin, Google Cloud's backlog), the rest demand and supply colour with an open home (the NVL576 delay and the Oberon stopgap of the Kyber question, TSMC's fabs, the AI debt market of the backstop questions), enforcement details of the H200 process, and consensus or valuation figures.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3045-- Decided (code, `placement.takes()`, under every configuration): a figure question's file takes its figures, guidance, estimates and revisions \"and what makes that figure more or less likely: the demand, supply, competition and pricing behind it\" (the standard's 5.1 test and D250 item 2's four paths); a launch, shipment or deployment event's file also takes the event's \"variants and stopgaps\"; a deal or obligation's file also takes \"the counterparties' own plans, financing and demand that bear on it\"; a policy process's file also takes \"its enforcement and evasion … and the affected parties' own plans and statements about it\". The system prompt `placement-narrow-v4` is unchanged: it says how the line is applied (whoever says it, with or without a size, the narrowest covering question only, nothing a line covers is filed under none). The weight stays the judge's. The sink D207 guarded against is accepted as the price of the leeway, bounded by the narrowest-question rule and the driver questions.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3046-- Proof (`proof-takes-wide.txt`; `harness/resend_takes_wide.py`: every stored placement request of arm 4 draw 1, 212 requests, re-sent once with the four clauses edited in the stored text, the edit checked byte for byte against the code on the run's 46 questions; one draw, one send, $0.18 at list price): gold supporting matters with a filed statement 40 → 98 of the extracted ones, core 69 → 75; statements filed 358 → 690 and links 390 → 717 over the draw; links on the total and Data Center revenue questions 22% → 32% of all links (Data Center 48 → 152, total revenue 39 → 79, the accelerator-share question 8 → 78, China share 17 → 38). By gold class over the 104 gold-article requests: supporting statements gaining a home 62, losing 0; core 11 and 2; gold not-kept 41 and 1; unlisted 23 and 1; optional 12 and 0. The two core losses were sampler noise: sent three times as stored and three times changed, the company's \"nearly $20 billion in CPU sales\" statement is filed 1/3 → 3/3 under the Vera CPU question and the \"80% of core technologies domestic\" statement 2/3 → 3/3 under the China share question (`proof-takes-wide-lost-core.txt`). The first wording also named \"decisions behind it\", a word D250 does not have: it filed hires, an R&D centre, game launches and an executive's pay under revenue and margin questions (`proof-takes-wide-a-with-decisions.txt`: not-kept gains 53, unlisted 35, total revenue 39 → 115, sink share 36%); the word was removed and the proof re-run (the numbers above), the supporting class unchanged (97 → 98).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3047-- What the leeway costs, written down: the noise the placement step used to remove is the extraction's noise and now reaches the judge (41 gold not-kept statements over the gold articles of one draw: ecosystem adoption lists, a CEO's generic claim, restated known deals, one game expansion under total revenue). The share of noise among pieces reaching judgement, 15% in arm 4, is estimated at about 22% after this change (from the gold-article counts, not measured end to end); filed statements double, so the judgement count and cost a draw are estimated to grow by 60–90% (arm 4: 310 judgements, $0.92 a draw; judging-v6's longer answers add to it). The owner of that noise is the extraction standard's 5.1 item 5 and 5.3 (common knowledge, current arrangements, product details), not the placement step; it is the next class to count, at the extraction. Tests: `tests/test_placement.py` (the D259 case). Measured by re-sent stored requests, not by an arm (Alex: \"不要再跑这些有的没的臂了\"); the default configuration stays `poc-v69`, and since the change is code every configuration run from now on carries it.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3048-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3049-## D260 · 2026-11-02 · A judgement is a forecast against a reference: the rung the evidence in force makes most likely, judged against what the market expects; the answer states the reference and the implied outcome (judging-v6)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3050-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3051-- Alex, 2026-11-02, asked whether the judge's stance should stay an absolute-band lookup (the current reading) or be judged relative to expectations: \"门槛没有标准，按照你作为 hedge fund analyst 的认识来定\". Decided by Claude under that delegation: the definition below is Claude's analyst judgement, recorded as such, not Alex's words.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3052-- Mechanism (arm 4 draw 1, all 356 judgements read, `research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/review-2026-11-02.md` §7 and `proof-judging-v6.txt`): 8 of 314 later judgements moved a rung and 320 of 356 reasons say \"remains\"; the FY2027 total revenue question was judged 12 times at neutral while its upward pushes grew from 1 to 35, every reason \"the $392 billion estimate is inside the band … does not establish $400 billion\"; the gross-margin judgement wrote \"leans toward rung 2 but does not warrant moving\"; the 2027 hyperscaler-capex theme stayed below the band management's own forecast names because the forecast \"is not fact\". The judging-v5 prompt asked the judge to \"be precise about what is established\" and said only fact can establish a rung: the model read \"established\" as the bar for leaving a rung and the consensus figure as the anchor. A second cause stays open: the ladder's neutral band is written at opening without naming what it compares against (PRD 06 ladder rule 2 asks for it); that is the extraction's rule and is not changed here.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3053:- Decided, the analyst's rule: (1) the rung is a forecast, the outcome the evidence in force makes most likely at the due date, not the one it has proved; \"not established\" is a statement of confidence, never a reason to stay. (2) The reference is what the market expects: consensus, the company's guidance, the stated plan or deadline; a consensus or guidance figure alone keeps the judgement at the reference's rung and, once other evidence has arrived, is never the reason to stay. (3) The judge derives the outcome the evidence implies (reported figures and guidance give a run-rate; a quantified revision, a customer's demand number, a supplier's constraint, a confirmed delay or cancellation shift it), checks it against the dependencies' conclusions (a part cannot exceed its whole; a figure spanning several periods or products gives the question only its share), compares it with the rung boundaries and moves when it crosses one. (4) Weight follows tier and novelty: fact fixes what is known; party statements are the strongest forecast input; third-party views and rumours move the forecast in proportion to their specificity; a repeat, another outlet or an opinion with no new fact or calculation moves nothing. (5) The answer states `reference` and `implied_outcome` as required fields from `judging-v6` (`judging.schema_for`; code refuses an empty one; stored beside the rung in `judgements.reference` / `implied_outcome`; a ledger written before v6 gains the columns at its first write), so the D3 stance gold can read the reasoning, not only the rung. Written where the judgement is specified: PRD 06 State rules (`docs/system-design/new-facts.js` STATE_RULES, the generated block) and this record.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3054-- Proof (`proof-judging-v6.txt`, `proof-judging-v6b.txt`: the last stored judgement request of 14 theses of arm 4 draw 1 re-sent once each under v6 and read beside the stored v5 answers, about a cent): every answer names the reference and derives the implied outcome. Six rungs moved against the stored ones: non-GAAP gross margin 3 → 2 (Q1 reported 75% and Q2 guided 75% sit on the rung-2 boundary), 2027 hyperscaler capex 4 → 5 (management's own \"more than $1 trillion\"), China accelerator share 4 → 5 (share \"fallen to zero\"), China H200 authorization No → Yes (a reported plan to permit named firms and reported progress in reviews, six months before the deadline), Data Center revenue 2 → 3 ($355–360 billion derived from Q1 and the total-revenue proxy, below the $360 billion boundary), Blackwell+Rubin revenue 2 → 1 in the first send by annualising a two-year \"$1 trillion visibility\" figure to $545 billion, a part above its whole: clause (3)'s consistency check was added for it and the re-send gives rung 2 ($320–360 billion, a share of the Data Center segment). Total revenue stays at 3 with the arithmetic shown (H1 $172.6 billion from Q1 and the Q2 guide; $400 billion needs more than $227 billion in H2). Prompt 2,453 → 3,782 characters: the request defined neither what a rung means nor a reference and its \"established\" wording forced the defect; the two sentences that carried it were cut. Configuration `poc-v90` (poc-v89 with judging-v6); the default stays `poc-v69`. Tests: `tests/test_stance_fields.py`. Measured by re-sent stored requests, not by an arm (Alex: \"不要再跑这些有的没的臂了\").\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3055-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3056-## D261 · 2026-11-02 · A ruler or gold that is built and reviewed is never changed again\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3057-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3058-- Alex, 2026-11-02, while the judgement ruler (D3) was being built: \"你的尺子做出来和金标真的不能再动了，已经造成了3天的各种漂移，非常的严重，我需要你记录到我们的决策和原则里面，我们做完的review过的尺子金标不能再动了\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3059-- The drift he names, counted: the extraction ruler went from the first standard (D229, 2026-10-29) to the signed page version 3 (D243, the same day) to version 5 (D250, 2026-10-31), the gold was re-derived from version 3 to version 5 with 62 recorded changes, and every score between D248 and 2026-10-31 had been read against the version-3 gold (the \"假的测量\" of 2026-10-31); the judgement step had no ruler at all until today. Three days of numbers that cannot be compared with each other.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3060-- Decided (his words; written at the decision it governs, AGENTS §7.1): once a ruler and its gold have been reviewed (readers who did not write them read them against the decisions; Alex signed), neither the definition nor the gold changes again. A defect found later is a dated correction record beside the gold (`corrections-*.json`), printed with every score and never merged in. A new definition is a new version that only his decision opens, with its own gold derived from scratch; old scores stay as they were and are never compared with the new. A ruler under construction is edited only until that review, and nothing is scored against it before.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3061-- What is locked by this record: the extraction standard page (`docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html`, version 3 signed D243, with D250's four boundaries and counting unit) and `golden-v5/` (sha256 in `golden-v5.sha256`): no version 6; the loop's desk ruler (`research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/README.md`, D1–D3). What is still under construction and locks at his review: the judgement ruler `research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/judgement-gold/ruler-v1.md`, its reader brief, question list and gold `gold-v1.json` (the sign-off is a separate record).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3062-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3063-## D262 · 2026-11-02 · The judgement ruler (D3) and its gold are fixed: the gold is reader B's answers; frozen at sha256 636c056d1e4252fa…\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3064-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3065-- Alex, 2026-11-02, after reading the two readers' reasoning on every disagreement (readers A and B differed on 3 of 23 questions by range or yes/no and on 12 of 20 direction labels; the system disagreed with the draft on the total revenue and Vera CPU questions in every draw): \"那就不要理A了；我们就go with B 好吧，定下尺子金表\".\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3136-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3137-## D272 · 2026-11-03 · `poc-v103` (extraction v74d) is the default\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3138-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3139-- Alex, on D271's result: \"做成默认\". `scripts/replay.py --config` defaults to `poc/config/poc-v103.json`; README, AGENTS (§9's run settings paragraph) and the entry-point test (`tests/test_concurrency.py`) name it. `poc-v94` stays as the record of D267.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3140-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3141-## D273 · 2026-11-03 · Second review of the extraction request: five misread sentences fixed in text (v74e), the filing structure measured three ways (v74f–v74h); none made the default\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3142-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3143-- Alex: \"你要不要同时你和codex subagent 再深度看到底哪里还是没写对，还要进一步优化结构，给我答案\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3144-- Found (`research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/design-v78-fields.md` §13): the model's own account of seven misses under v74d (`probe-v103-omitted.txt`): \"another company's matter when you cannot say through which path\" read as \"the item does not state the path\" (a customer's backlog, a supplier's revenue: standard 5.1 kind 2's own example class); \"a second item for the same fact\" read across articles (\"item\" names both the article and an evidence record); \"dated to an earlier month\" applied to an expansion under way; a refusal still in force read as common knowledge (standard §5.3: a decision, plan or forecast still in force keeps its weight); \"rental prices for older models are climbing\" read as a typical claim (standard 5.1 lists it as new information). One reported miss was the scorer's (the Omniverse decision written in all three sends under another quote). The independent Codex review (`codex-audit-v74d-r1.md`): the role's reject list and the closing check state one rule twice with eleven differences; every numeric takes line repeats one tail, so the narrowest question cannot be told apart.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3145-- Built: v74e (`poc-v104`): one reject list, owned by the closing check; the five sentences rewritten from the standard (the analyst supplies the connection; a retold plan or decision in force keeps its place; judge the action, not its tense; a market measure moving now is new; the product-progress boundary covers every product line); T8 reads calculations and specific judgements. v74f (`poc-v105`): v74e with the tail and the period allowance stated once in the links rule (`placement.takes(paths_once)`, `FILING_RULE_PATHS_ONCE`, `extraction.PATHS_ONCE_VARIANTS`). v74g (`poc-v106`): tail kept, the v74f links rule. v74h (`poc-v107`): v74f plus the company-wide revenue question as the home of indirect evidence (`FILING_RULE_ROOT_FALLBACK`). Variants keep v74's behaviour flags; `extraction.FILING_RULE_VARIANTS` names the links rule each reads. Test `tests/test_v74d_text.py::test_filing_variants_change_only_the_takes_lines_and_the_links_rule`; suite 285.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3146-- Measured (50 stored articles, three sends each, one round): core presences v74d 59 → v74e 65 / v74f 64 / v74g 64 / v74h 68; supporting 87 → 122 / 70 / 93 / 95; noise 89 → 107 / 53 / 98 / 100 (56 → 83 / 38 / 69 / 64 net of long quotes). The structural finding: whether a statement is kept is decided by whether an open question takes it (D209 with D264); the total-revenue question's shared tail makes it both the only home of indirect evidence (partner adoption, supplier expansion, a country's capex plan) and the sink of noise, so a stricter filing rule removes both.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3147-- Status: the default stays `poc-v103` (D272). Lean put to Alex: v74h (`poc-v107`), the most core with none missed and noise near the old default's, request 4,000 characters shorter; v74e and v74f are the two ends. The next structural lever is not in the prompt: specific homes for indirect evidence (D208's driver questions, designed, not built) would let filing be strict without losing it; the seed questions belong to the frozen ruler, so that is a new ruler version, opened only by Alex.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3148:- Amended 2026-11-02 22:10, after Alex (\"可是最新的问自己啊兜底不是废话变多了吗？\" then \"收窄那三句，直接测\"): v74h's extra noise against v74d (89 → 100) came from three exceptions this review added to the closing check, not from the fallback: \"a specific consequence\" (the standard's 5.3 row lists \"a delay leaves rivals a window\" as not kept), \"a market measure moving now\" (applied to general statements), and \"a party's own revenue, capacity, orders or contracted amounts\" (let existing deals with amounts in). v74i (`poc-v108`) narrows the three to the standard's words. Measured on the same 50 articles: core 59 → 70, supporting 87 → 117, noise 89 → 81 (56 → 54 net of long quotes), no core matter missed in all three sends (three under v74d). Candidate; the default is Alex's word.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3149:- Amended 2026-11-02 23:01, after Alex (\"那致癌案的核心事实不就退步了 … 找codex和你一起review 找到突破的方法\"; \"其实你也可以改成推理xhigh, max 都试试看\"): the debt-backstop article's core regression under v74i is an incomplete walk of a long item at low reasoning (some sends skip whole sections; nine sends each: the opening market judgement 7/9 at low, 9/9 at medium). Measured on the 50 articles with v74i's text: low 70 core / 112 supporting / 81 noise, medium 73 / 140 / 120, high 73 / 171 / 150; xhigh exhausts a 32,000-token budget on long items and returns empty answers; \"max\" is not a value the API accepts. Codex's section walk (v74j, low) did not stop the collapse and lowered recall. A length rule simulated at no cost (medium for items of 15,000 characters or more): 74 / 118 / 87. Not built: a reasoning setting by item length is a code change (settings are chosen by source category); Alex's decision.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3150-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3151:## D274 · 2026-11-03 · The extraction production prompt is frozen at v74i (`poc-v108`); the unadopted variants are retired\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3152-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3153:- Alex: \"感觉已经瓶颈了，上一个版本是不是freeze作为我们的抽取生产提示词吧。你顺道把所有其他不相关的clean up sanitize吧\". Read as: the last prompt version, v74i (D273's\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3154-  three exceptions narrowed), at low reasoning, the configuration every reasoning test of the third round kept unchanged; it beat the D272 default on core\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3155-  matters, supporting matters and noise on the 50 stored articles (D273 amended). If he meant v74d, the default goes back to `poc-v103` with one line.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3156-- Frozen: `poc/config/poc-v108.json` is the replay default (`scripts/replay.py`, README, AGENTS); `tests/test_frozen_extraction_prompt.py` pins the sha256 of\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3157:  role-v74i, review-v74i, categories-v74i and the configuration, the links rule (`placement.FILING_RULE_ROOT_FALLBACK`, now a constant of its own), the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3158-  code-written takes lines and the evidence schema; a one-character change to the check fails it (mutant checked). AGENTS \"Where to look first\" names it.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3159-- Retired, never run as a stored run and never a default, backed up first (`research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/retired-2026-11-03/retired-variants.tar.gz`,\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3160-  54 files, sha256 manifest beside it, restore verified): prompt files of v74b, v74c, v74e–v74h, v74j, v74k, v76, v77, v78, v79, v80; configurations\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3161-  poc-v96, v97, v98–v102, v104–v107, v109–v114; `tests/test_evidence_fields.py` (the field route's tests leave with it). Code removed with them: the v78–v80\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3162-  classification fields and `evidence_rule` in the sift (and the `>= 78` version gates that would have caught any future version), the section markers\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3163-  of v74j, the variant tables of v74f–v74k; `REVIEW_VERSIONS_ALSO` keeps 72–75. Kept: v94 and v95 (stored runs), v74d / `poc-v103` (D272's default), every\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3164-  research record, proof, saved answer and probe. The request bytes of `poc-v94`, `poc-v95`, `poc-v103` and `poc-v108` on three stored articles are\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3165:  identical before and after the cleanup (sha256 compared). Tests: `test_v74_production_text.py` (v74d and v74i), the review gate test states v76–v80 do\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3166-  not exist; suite 283.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3167-- Sanitized: no company, product or bench name in the frozen prompt files; no credential pattern in any changed or new file.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3168-- Not done: the length rule for reasoning (D273 amended) stays a proposal; it would be a new version opened by Alex.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3169-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3170-## Decisions recorded on `main` while the extraction work ran on its branch (renumbered at the 2026-11-03 merge)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3171-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3172:`main` and `fix/extraction-quality-2026-10-28` both numbered from D181 after D170. At the merge the branch kept its numbers (D171–D274) and the 62 decisions `main` recorded were renumbered in order: D181→D275, D182→D276, D183→D277, D184→D278, D185→D279, D186→D280, D187→D281, D188→D282, D189→D283, D190→D284, D191→D285, D192→D286, D193→D287, D194→D288, D195→D289, D196→D290, D197→D291, D198→D292, D199→D293, D200→D294, D201→D295, D202→D296, D203→D297, D204→D298, D205→D299, D206→D300, D207→D301, D208→D302, D209→D303, D210→D304, D211→D305, D212→D306, D213→D307, D214→D308, D215→D309, D216→D310, D217→D311, D218→D312, D219→D313, D220→D314, D221→D315, D222→D316, D223→D317, D225→D318, D226→D319, D227→D320, D228→D321, D229→D322, D230→D323, D231→D324, D232→D325, D233→D326, D234→D327, D235→D328, D236→D329, D237→D330, D238→D331, D239→D332, D240→D333, D241→D334, D258→D335, D259→D336. References in `main`'s files were renumbered with them; commit messages keep the old numbers.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3173-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3174-## D275 · 2026-10-26 · Rebuild the frontend around the collected English library\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3175-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3176-- Alex asked to read the current backend and database and update the frontend to match. The [implementation contract](research/2026-10-26-library-ui/plan.md) covers the read-only projection, versioned UI data contract and library interface. Extraction, group assignment, matching, scoring and acceleration experiments are unchanged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3177-- The default page browses the collected English Jev library directly. Stored groups organize peer theses; ungrouped theses remain visible. No parent thesis, group score or dependency is invented. The existing Idea submission and graph remain a separate explicit user action.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3178-- A full-library HTTP/MCP read and the standalone build share the same dated bundle writer. Expose stored identity, group memberships, all evidence sources, replacement arrival, dependency resolutions and succession. Historical reads use recording dates; original source text is preserved. A new snapshot replaces scoped IDs as a whole.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3179-- Default read-service and standalone-build ledger/items paths align with the completed English library. Existing explicit path overrides and old bundle adapters remain supported. No paid request, prompt/model switch, ingestion, deployment, commit or push is part of this slice.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3180-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3181-- Result: [current-library frontend](../poc/reports/2026-10-26-library-ui/results.md) renders all 90 theses, 18 groups and 51 memberships, with complete identity/source projection and dated relationship display. The full Python suite passes 151 tests; 27 UI tests and eight mutation checks pass, and eight final-build browser lifecycle checks pass. JavaScript is 141,125 bytes; current-corpus validation is 25.3 ms in the final local sample. All three protected database hashes are unchanged. Existing semantic/index limitations and the acceleration work remain separate.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3182-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3183-## D276 · 2026-10-26 · Sentence-case interface labels and bar-separated metadata\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3184-\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3786-`main` on 2026-11-04 when the worktree was removed (D359), its text unchanged below. Its D206 is a different decision on `main`.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3787-Its quality review is carried as `docs/research/2026-10-28-quality-review/` (documents and scripts; the comparison databases stay in\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3788-the backup). The writer fix it names was not carried: `main` reads cited ids as a set where it serves them (`bundle.library`,\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3789-`service`), which covers the same defect. The succession gap it records was not checked against today's code.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3790-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3791-- Alex, 16:30: \"你先停止吧，把这个db 封存，替换成最新的FE可以读取然后把这个 bloating evidence 的问题给记录下来，很严重，需要解决\". Earlier (16:12): \"证据膨胀是一个问题，我们之后要想办法deal\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3792-- The run (`english-v34-nvda-3m-2026-10-28`, poc-v34, the D202–D205 writer) completed 59 days, 2026-07-01 to 08-28: 1,232 items, 69 theses, 7,091 calls, $5.80. It is sealed read-only as `poc/data/sealed-2026-10-28-v34-nvda-3m-through-0828/` (SQLite online backups, SHA256SUMS, logs and scripts; the run folder is left resumable). The front end reads it from 16:35: the served defaults switched in the five places the README names (main checkout), `poc/mock/index.html` rebuilt, the API restarted in `service-3m-2026-10-28/` (`/days` 2026-07-01..08-28, 69 theses).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3793-- Why it stops: evidence bloat. The Data Center revenue thesis (v10) carried 1,768 linked pieces by 08-27 and FY2027 revenue (v2) 1,733; v10's judging request was 292 KB with 698 evidence ids shown; the model mislabels one id among dozens of pushes about every other attempt, the code refuses the answer, two refusals halt the day. Today: 14 judge answers refused by code, 10 on v10/v2/v13, two days halted on v10 alone in 16:05–16:21. Of 25 pieces linked to v2, 10 bear on the question (Claude's reading); the judge ever cited 23–27% of what is linked. The census, the one-case traces and the rule candidates are in `docs/research/2026-10-28-quality-review/report.md` §2 D (and A–C, measured first); the step is Alex's to pick.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3794-- Found while switching the front end: one judgement (v2, id 736) cited an id twice and the UI contract (`thesis-ui/2`, uniqueItems) refused the dataset. The writer now stores each cited id once (`judging._record`, test `test_a_judgement_stores_each_cited_id_once`, red on the old writer); the two readers of sealed ledgers (`bundle.library`, `service` thesis bundles, main checkout) read the set, since a sealed ledger does not change.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3795-- The other halts of the day, each resumed by the run's `watch.sh` and recorded in the cost ledger: the judging output cap (D205), the Mac sleeping, three transport errors, one \"database is locked\" (a reader held the ledger over the 5 s busy timeout), one hung call (55 min at 0% CPU under the VPN; a stall detector was added to the watcher).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3796-- Amendment, 17:05. Alex, on seeing an empty thesis in the front end (\"why is this here? there is no evidence and why is this a thesis\"; then \"你直接把它移除，这是我们自己的失误\"): v68, \"What stand-alone CPU revenue will NVIDIA report for calendar 2027?\", opened on the run's last day by the succession rule (D168: same quantity, next period, after v24) from one statement (\"$20 billion in 2026 and more than $40 billion in 2027\"); the writer linked that statement to v7 and v24 (as a repeat of the $20 billion piece) and not to the successor it opened, so v68 stood with no evidence and, judging running only on arrivals, no judgement. Class: 1 of 69 theses with no evidence; 1 of 2 successions (v9 after v8 has 59 pieces). The sealed folder stays untouched; the front end, the API and the page build now read `poc/data/served-2026-10-28-v34-nvda-3m-through-0828/views.sqlite`, the same ledger with v68's rows removed (views, view_keys, rungs, successions, view_switches, views_fts; the append-only triggers dropped in that copy only; its README lists this). The writer gap (a succession's opening evidence is not linked to the successor) is an open defect in `writing.py` for the next slice.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3797-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3798:## D359 · 2026-11-04 · The code builds only the frozen prompts (extraction v74i, judging-v7); old worktrees removed; the preflight reads the one-decider requests\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3799-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3800-- Alex, on Claude's list of the two open cleanup items (the old worktrees, and the code paths only retired prompt versions take, with the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3801-  cost that old versions could then no longer be re-run, only read from their stored results): \"你看完你告诉我呀\", then \"ok\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3802-- **Worktrees.** Removed: `fix/thesis-admission-v11` (its 102 MB of data were five SQLite files whose contents equal `main`'s; only the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3803-  header counters differed), `cleanup/sequential-requests` (685 MB, 244 files byte-identical to `main`'s `poc/data`), `feat/parallel-day`\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3804-  (two text changes `main` already holds, 94 MB of the 2026-10-25/26 test outputs) and `feat/thesis-admission-v12` (a writer fix `main`\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3805-  covers where it reads, the sealed-run decision carried as D358, its quality review carried to `docs/research/2026-10-28-quality-review/`).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3806-  What was kept from each is in `/Users/lchingen/hivemind-backups/old-worktrees-2026-11-04/` (README there); the branches stay. Kept:\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3807-  `fix/extraction-quality-2026-10-28`, whose ignored folders hold the stored end-to-end runs (679 MB; v91, v92, v94, v95), the results\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3808-  any later comparison reads.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3809:- **One path in the code.** `extraction.py` builds the v74i request only: the Chinese builder, the per-version schemas, field notes,\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3810:  paragraph accounts, the placement call's paths and every version gate are gone; `SUPPORTED_VERSIONS = ('v74i',)` and a configuration\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3811-  naming another version is refused before any request (`require_supported`). The answer checks are unchanged except what only retired\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3812-  versions used: a bare year is a calendar year, an unlinked statement stays for the handover's 'no home' drop, the admission check reads\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3813-  `settled_by` and the obligation horizon, a candidate cites only groups its answer declares. `placement.py` keeps the takes lines, the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3814:  v74i filing rule and the candidate-id pattern; the separate placement call is gone. `views/judging.py` builds judging-v7 only (theme\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3815-  block, evidence in view, the reference) and refuses another version. The parallel runner and the stream no longer pass the never-shown\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3816-  groups. Matching, the Idea API and the store are unchanged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3817-- **Proof, at no cost.** The three draws of the frozen v108 run (D354) replayed through the code from their stored answers, every paid call\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3818-  refused: before the change and after it, all 3,031 requests built byte for byte the same (key order included), no request the archive\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3819-  could not answer, and all 23 tables of each replayed ledger equal to the stored ledger. Suite: 260 tests pass (289 before; the tests of\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3820-  retired versions left with them, the rest now run on `poc-v108`); the frozen-file tests, the UI tests and `docs/check.py` pass.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3821-- **The preflight reads the one-decider requests** (D354's defect 4): it recovers the question ids a stored request showed from its\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3822-  [Open questions] block and replays the answer against them, reads items as the feed does (`testdb.item_of`), counts a row of a retired\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3823-  version or configuration as not replayed, and defaults to draw 1 of the frozen run. On it: 243 of 243 extraction answers replayed (was\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3824-  229, with 14 failing on unparsed item fields), 726 statements and candidates judged, 12 refused.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3825-- **Files retired** (Git keeps them): 41 configurations and 80 prompt files that no code, test, script or UI file loads, among them the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3826-  stored controls `poc-v94`, `poc-v95` and `poc-v103` (D274 kept them; their stored runs remain, they can no longer be re-run, and D274's\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3827-  one-line return to `poc-v103` now needs a decision and code). Kept: `poc-v108`, the Idea API's configurations and the files its tests\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3828-  and scripts load, and `poc-v22` (read by `scripts/recall_oracle.py`). The backup manifest of D274's retired variants is restored beside\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3829-  its archive, since a report links it.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3830:- A new version of either prompt is a new decision with its own code path, measured against v74i and judging-v7 (D274, D354).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3831-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3832-## D360 · 2026-11-04 · PRD 10: the one-home tie and split replace the second home (§5.2); the decision rule counts against luck and per question by code (§6)\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3833-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3834-- Alex, on Claude's message giving the conclusion, the one test and the two PRD corrections (the decision rule as written fails the control\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3835-  against itself; §5.2's \"另一方的题开着…一并挂上\" contradicts D207): \"go\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3836-- **§5.2.** One home stays (D207). A statement bearing on two specific questions goes to the one whose quantity it measures most directly; a\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3837-  statement giving a separate figure for each of two questions is written as two evidence items, one under each (the code stores two items quoting\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3838-  one sentence as one piece with both links). Both sentences are in the links rule of v74l (`links-v74l.json`).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3839-- **§6.** Totals by reassignment (each article's six answers re-split between the arms 4,000 times; a change counts when fewer than 5% of re-splits\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3840-  reach it): development reach up, parking under v1/v22 down, not-kept spans not up, core not down; held-out reach not down, not-kept not up, core\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3841-  not down. Per question, by code against the gold, both sets together: 3 net drops, 2 net full drops (every control send, no variant send),\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3842-  5 net new noise statements or 3 net full new noise statements fail; a move to another question the gold uses the fact for that is not broader is\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3846-  (`docs/research/2026-11-04-filing-end-to-end/prd-amendment-proposal.md`, `log.md` rows 10–16).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3847-- The test then runs once: arms `stored` and `v74l` (configuration name poc-v115), three sends each, on the 54 development and 15 held-out\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3848-  articles, predictions frozen with their sha256 before the first send.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3849-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3850-## D361 · 2026-11-04 · After v74l's failed test: size what complete evidence is worth at the judgement before more extraction design; the fallback stays\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3851-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3852-- Alex, on Claude's report of the three-round reflection with Codex (`docs/research/2026-11-04-filing-end-to-end/reflection-v74l.md`), which\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3853-  recommended giving the frozen judge the gold's own evidence for the three questions the frozen runs miss for want of evidence, and leaning to keep\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3854-  the total-revenue fallback until that result: \"按照你的提以来，但是你一定是自己反思多轮之后才给出的行动\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3855-- The next step of PRD 10 is that test: custom silicon (v16), operating margin (v10) and NVIDIA capex (v12) at the window end 2026-07-14 of the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3856-  frozen v108 draw 1, the gold's cited passages supplied as constructed evidence through the production judging code, three sends each, and v16's\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3857-  stored request three times as control (12 sends). Designed, built and attacked in rounds of Claude's own review, recorded before the send.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3858:- The fallback sentence stays in production (frozen v74i, D274); its deletion is decided after this result.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3859-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3860-## D362 · 2026-11-04 · The two narrow delivery fixes the complete-evidence test points to are piloted, one at a time, on their motivating cases\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3861-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3862-- Alex, on Claude's report of the complete-evidence test (D361: operating margin and capex are delivery problems, custom silicon an interpretation\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3863-  gap) and its proposal of two narrow changes, each first tried on the stored article that motivated it: \"你继续啊不要scope drift and strongly follow\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3864-  evidence of your discovery and learning\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3865-- Fix 1, operating margin: a fact filed under the right question is refused because the model rewrote a comparison sentence (\"Nvidia's operating\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3866-  margin was roughly 66 percent\" for \"Micron's operating margin was 80.4 percent, compared with Nvidia's roughly 66 percent\"). Built where the evidence\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3867-  points with the least change: the quote check maps such a rewrite back to the one source sentence it came from, so nothing the model reads changes\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3868-  (a change to what the model reads changed what it writes in v74l); validated by replaying every stored refusal through the code, at no cost.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3869-- Fix 2, capex: a figure question's takes line names the figures its quantity is defined from (capital expenditure from operating cash flow and free\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3870-  cash flow), written by code per measure; first sent on the article that carries the cash-flow figures, three sends against three as stored.\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3953-  design-page passages that contradicted decisions in force were corrected.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3954-- Reviewed in seven rounds of read-only Codex review by angle (the register against this log, AGENTS new against old, the PRDs and design\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3955-  page against the decisions in force, the guides against the code and runs); serious findings per round 30, 9 (and 13 classes in the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3956-  PRDs), 7, 7, 3, 6 and 5, each checked against its source before a change; after the last, only PRD 10's two lines remain, left for\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3957-  Alex. Found on the way: the default Jev path chooses no dependencies although D51 has matching choose them.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3958-- Open for Alex: the seven items at the head of `docs/DECISIONS.md`.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3959-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3960-## D368 · 2026-11-05 · Alex's answers to the seven items left open by the consolidation\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3961-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3962-- Alex, on the seven items at the head of `docs/DECISIONS.md` (D367): \"1. 这个你记住，我们要做 2. 做 3. 好那就按照后面的那条来 4. 好你来定 5. 你要来帮我看到底做不做\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3963-  6. 你看该怎么处理核实 7. 不，用英文吧。\"; then \"你开始逐条改，不要drift, 记录下来把1-7都清理了我们再commit push,开始快速做\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3964-- Decided:\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3965:  1. The asset-thesis rungs stated against guidance, each thesis naming its favourable end (D186), and the rename of `industry_aggregate`\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3966:     to `shared_quantity` (D191 point 4) are built in the next extraction version. The frozen v74i stays until then (D274); the new\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3967-     version is measured against it.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3968-  2. The three decided rules not yet built are built, each designed and measured as its own slice (AGENTS §2, §7): a company's own\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3969-     quantity is a thesis under that company, private companies included (D187); a later item may add a dependency to an existing thesis\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:3970:     (D191 point 2); the matching step chooses a new thesis's dependencies (D51), which the default Jev path does not ask today.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3971-  3. At the due day pull mode closes the due questions and does nothing else (D356); D248 boundary 2's step that opens the next-deadline\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3972-     successor of an event question falling due unresolved is dropped.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3973-  4. Settled by Claude on Alex's delegation, by D208's design: a seed question's dependency arrow means \"supports\". For filing, the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3974-     supporting (driver) question is the narrower one, so a statement linked to both goes to it, as `extraction.narrowest_links` does\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3975-     today. For judging, the supported (root) question reads the supporting questions' conclusions, so drivers and themes are judged\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3976-     before their roots. Today the judging code reads the stored edge the other way: the driver reads the root and is judged after it\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3977-     (`seeding.seed_views` stores the seed's `depends_on` as the driver's dependency). The fix separates the two uses of the edge; it\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3978-     changes judgements, so it is measured before it enters the default.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3979-  5. Settled by Claude on Alex's delegation: PRD 10 is corrected without changing any rule. §4 names the frozen standard's version 5 and\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3980-     §5 carries a status line (its links-rule version failed in §8 step 5; D361 keeps the fallback sentence).\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3981-  6. Settled by Claude on Alex's delegation: the three statements of the frozen extraction standard page that later decisions changed are\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-3982-     noted in a dated correction record beside it, `docs/prd/05-extraction-standard-corrections.md`; the page is not edited (D261). Each\n--\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4411-  build and Stage A are unchanged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4412-- **Scope:** a probe of a few cents (AGENTS §7.3, \"Small first, then one run\"). It measures nothing: six answers, one draw.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4413-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4414-## D403 · 2026-11-10 · An event's due day is a stated date or the last day of the thesis's period; the model picks no other day\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4415-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4416-- **Asked:** \"事件类问题（比如“监管机构会不会批准这笔收购”）的到期日怎么定？我现在的设计只允许取两种日子：文章或题目里写明的日期，或题目所说期间的最后一天；模型不能自己估一个日子。这比老系统的说法更严（老系统只说“写明这件事在哪一天评定”）。你同意吗？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4417-  - Options: keep it narrower (recommended): the day comes from the period Step 1 set, the same thesis gets the same day on every\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4418-    send, and a reader can check it; the cost is that an event with no date in the article and no period in the thesis is\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4419-    declined. Or production's wider sentence: the model judges when the matter will be settled and sets a day; more flexible, and\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4420-    three sends of one thesis may set three days.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4421-  - Alex: \"保持更严 (Recommended)\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4422-- **Decided:** on the clean path's ladder step, an event's due day is the date the thesis or the article gives, or the last day of\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:4423:  the period the thesis names (the company's current fiscal year-end for a pending regulatory decision with no date, as v74i line\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4424-  16 has it). The model chooses no other day; an event that gives neither is declined as \"nothing in the topic can be checked on\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:4425:  a date\". This is narrower than v74i line 26 by his decision.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4426-- **Scope:** the clean path's ladder step. Production's frozen sentence is unchanged.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4427-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4428-## D404 · 2026-11-10 · After the probe: change the request for its three classes, send the same six again, then build\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4429-\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4430-- **Asked:** \"试发读完了：提示词主干管用，但有三类问题（1. 引用文章原话时会改词或抄错来源；2. 问题里写“本文提到的……”，离开文章就看不懂；3. 世界大事类的题被贴了看涨看跌标签，程序检查拦不住）。下一步怎么走？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4431-  - Options: change and send once more (recommended): \"我针对这三类问题改提示词（各一句）和一条程序检查，先花 2 美分问模型“你当时是依据哪句话这么做的”来定位原因，然后把同样 6 道题再发一次（约 1 美分）看是否改好。改好了就按原授权动手写程序。\"; build at once, with the three classes changed in the request and the check, and see in Stage A whether they are fixed; stop and let him read the answers.\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4432-  - Alex: \"改完再试发一次 (Recommended)\".\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4433-- **Decided:** (1) the model is asked, on the stored conversations of the probe, which instruction led it to each fault (about two\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4434-  cents); (2) the request gets one change for each of the three classes, and the check on a theme's state names refuses the\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4435-  company's labels; (3) the same six theses are sent once more (about one cent) and read as the first six were; (4) when the three\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4436-  classes are gone from those answers, the ladder step is built and Stage A sent on D401's terms (capped at $3; a missed line\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md-4437-  stops and goes to him; Stage B needs his word), with no further round of design review before the build. If they are not gone,\n--\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-182-</div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-183-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-184-<h2 id=\"decisions\"><span class=\"num\">已拍</span>Alex 拍板的 12 条</h2>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-185-<p>2026-10-29 Alex 签字（D243）。第 5 条他定得比我的倾向更严；其余 11 条按倾向：\"其他几条的意见我都ok，sign off\"。下表每条写定下的是什么、落在哪一节。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-186-<blockquote>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-187-<p>第 5 条，Alex 原话：\"这种典型的主张背景属于常识，基本上抽出来也没有太多的意义除非带数字和具体的叙事不然都是属于不采纳\"</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-188-<p>整体方向，Alex 原话：\"不是什么事情都是惊弓之鸟需要抽取，杂音还是很大的，我们整体应该倾向谨慎不要看什么都是线索的感觉，但是同时我们要敏感一些新的信息带来的增量不要错过\"</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-189-</blockquote>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-190-<div class=\"table-wrap mid\"><table>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-191-<thead><tr><th>#</th><th>定下的</th><th>在哪一节</th></tr></thead>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-192-<tbody>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-193-<tr><td>1</td><td>分量按信息量定档：核心要碰到关键判断，并带一个量、一个确定状态或一个带期间的预测；别家公司自己的经营数字、对公司是小事的，算辅助；预测离现在越远，越可能只是辅助，由判断定。缺金额、缺日期只影响分到哪一档，不是不留的理由</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 6 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:194:<tr><td>2</td><td>\"共同量\"按 D191 落实：任何一家公司之外、好几家都会受它影响的量或价格（合计支出、合约价、利率）都可以开题，开题理由叫 <code>shared_quantity</code>；期间按自然年。提示词和代码要跟着改</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 3 节 D 类</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-195-<tr><td>3</td><td>生态数字（论文数、获奖、下载量、开发者人数、大会人数）可选</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 6 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-196-<tr><td>4</td><td>在研公司的估值倍数、市值、孤零零的目标价可选；带推导的条件估值仍是辅助</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 5.3、6 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-197-<tr><td>5</td><td>典型的主张和背景是常识，没有数字和具体的叙事不收；不是常识的新信息，照第 5.1 节的规则判</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 5.1、5.3 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-198-<tr><td>6</td><td>旧事重提：重提的过去实际数可选；重提的季度指引和仍然有效的预测、计划按本来分量；文字或日期看不出是旧事的不算重提</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 5.3、6 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-199-<tr><td>7</td><td>收购算约束性义务（写明规模、尚未完成）</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 3 节 C 类</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-200-<tr><td>8</td><td>改提示词时的回归判法：全部文章各发一次和上一版比，\"别的版本都留住、只有这一版丢了\"的核心或辅助才算回归信号；它是诊断，验收仍是三次发送</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 9.3 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-201-<tr><td>9</td><td>来源层：一句话符合两行时取表里上面那行；混合的一条按主要说法定层，次要部分写进摘要</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 5.5 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-202-<tr><td>10</td><td>只有形容的引语不收</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 5.3 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-203-<tr><td>11</td><td>金标冻结后发现错：另记一份带理由的更正，写明改前改后，不覆盖原文件；测量用更正后的版本并注明</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 8 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-204-<tr><td>12</td><td>达标线里\"垃圾\"一项（每篇留下的无关陈述）用定稿金标重算，Luna 基线也重算</td><td class=\"nowrap\">第 9.2 节</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-205-</tbody></table></div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-206-\n--\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-267-<li><b>研究组</b>一件正在进行的事（一个产品换代及其部署、一笔融资或收购、一个政策过程、一轮投资或需求周期），把几个问题组织在一起，常常跨公司。它不是问题，也不代替开题判断。公司自己的报表行（收入、毛利率、费用、税率、资本开支）不带研究组，除非这一行本身就在追这样一件事；它也可以加入别的问题建的组<span class=\"src\">D165</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-268-</ol>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-269-<p><b>不进账本的：</b>归档找不到家的证据，记 <code>no home</code> 扔掉<span class=\"src\">D209</span>。评估时逐条读被扔的，分四种：抽取的垃圾；库里缺这个问题（覆盖缺口）；问题在却没挂上（归档错）；该开没开（开题错）。各归各的环节<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §7</span>。存储的表结构归 PRD 06 管。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-270-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-271-<h2 id=\"types\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>问题的五类：账本的几大类型</h2>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-272-<p>开题理由是 D184 定的四类，D236 把主驱动量扩到产品节点，所以写成五类。判两件事，互不顶替：这是谁的问题（标的还是主题）；为什么值得开（开题理由）。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-273-<div class=\"table-wrap wide\"><table>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-274-<thead><tr><th>类</th><th>开题理由</th><th>标的或主题</th><th>问什么</th><th>量还是事件</th><th>期间和到期</th><th>核对材料 <code>settled_by</code></th><th>出处</th></tr></thead>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-275-<tbody>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-276-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\"><b>A</b> 主驱动量</td><td><code>main_driver</code></td><td>标的</td><td>承载公司价值的那个年度量，不管公司指不指引：撑起业务的分部收入、毛利率、资本开支；跨行业如银行的净利息收入、零售商的同店销售、公用事业的费率基数、航空公司的燃油成本（当它是争论焦点时）。不是每一行报表数</td><td>量，五档</td><td>公司财年的今年或明年；到期日是这个数的发布日</td><td>公布这个数的公开材料，通常是年报</td><td>D184：<code>settled_by</code> 是 \"the public material that resolves it\"；PRD 06 梯子第 5 条</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-277-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\"><b>B</b> 主产品节点</td><td><code>main_driver</code></td><td>标的</td><td>承载公司价值的那一代产品哪天走到能带来收入的那一步（通常是开始出货）；发布、送样是它的证据，只有会分别下注的里程碑（新药的三期数据和获批）各一题<span class=\"src\">D248 第 3 条</span></td><td>事件，五档，或是非两档<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 梯子第 1 条</span></td><td>能判出结果的那天</td><td>公司公告、发货确认</td><td>D236</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-278-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\"><b>C</b> 约束性义务</td><td><code>binding_obligation</code></td><td>标的</td><td>公司以自己名义承担的：为别人的债务、租约或收入担保或提供信用支持；借钱给别人；承诺购买（向别人买产能或服务也算）；为客户的产能或收入兜底；或写明规模、尚未完成的入股或收购<span class=\"src\">D236；收购按 D243 第 7 条</span>。规模要大到能改变公司的收入、利润、现金或信用风险才开；够不上的单笔入股、收购、租约、授信不开题，陈述留不留照第 5 节判<span class=\"src\">D248 第 6 条</span>。不算：自己借钱、自己的租约、已完成或没写规模的投资。D239 选定的 role-v29 原文：\"Its own borrowing, its own leases and a completed or unsized investment are not obligations\"；D238 的记录写作 \"the company's own borrowing and leases and a completed or unsized stake do not\"</td><td>还没签：是非两档。已经承担（一笔或一个计划）：金额，五档</td><td>检查日最多在文章后 18 个月<span class=\"src\">D185</span>；已承担的按下一份年报</td><td>签约公告、年报承诺附注</td><td>D184、D185、D210、D236、D238、D243</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:279:<tr><td class=\"nowrap\"><b>D</b> 共同量</td><td><code>shared_quantity</code><span class=\"src\">D191、D243 第 2 条</span>；现行提示词和代码还叫 <code>industry_aggregate</code>，按这一页改</td><td>主题</td><td>任何一家公司之外、好几家都会受它影响的量或价格：几家公司的合计（云厂商资本开支）、价格（内存合约价、油价）、利率。同一总量的另一种人群、另一种说法是这个量的证据</td><td>量，五档</td><td>自然年的今年或明年。同一个量、同一年只有一个问题，由代码按\"主题＋量＋期间\"判<span class=\"src\">D197</span>；量的类别是 <code>other</code> 的不算</td><td>几家公司年报、统计发布、官方决定</td><td>D184、D191、D197、D243；PRD 06</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-280-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\"><b>E</b> 政策阶段</td><td><code>policy_stage</code></td><td>问的是一家公司的收入、利润、份额或产品进度，算标的，即使由政策驱动；问的是世界上的事（许可制度、利率、合计支出），算主题。D184 采纳的 role-v12 原文：\"A question about a company's revenue, profit, share or product progress is an asset thesis; put its ticker in object, even when policy or macroeconomics drives it\"</td><td>一个政策或监管过程到了哪一步，写明谁说了算</td><td>事件，五档或两档</td><td>能判出那一步的那天。文章没写日期的待决监管事项，用本财年末（role-v12 原文：\"A pending regulatory decision may lack a date; use the current fiscal year-end as its due date\"）；这个日期是研究员定的检查日，要标明<span class=\"src\">评审 §1 第 1 条</span></td><td>官方决定、公报</td><td>D184</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-281-</tbody></table></div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-282-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-283-<p>例子（跨行业）：</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-284-<ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-285-<li><b>A：</b>NVIDIA FY2027 数据中心收入；一家地区银行 FY2026 净利息收入；一家公用事业公司 2027 年费率基数。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-286-<li><b>B：</b>下一代机架系统能否在 2027 年底前开始出货；一家车企的新平台能否在 2026 年内开始交付。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-287-<li><b>C：</b>NVIDIA 为云客户产能兜底的义务在 FY2027 年报达到多少；一家保险公司是否在 2027 年中前为合资公司 5 亿美元债务签署担保。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-288-<li><b>D：</b>五家最大云厂商 2026 年合计资本开支；2027 年 DRAM 合约价相对 2026 年的变化、美联储 2026 年最后一次会议后的利率上限。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-289-<li><b>E：</b>中国是否在 2027-01-31 前正式批准本国公司进口 H200；美国是否在某日前对某类芯片实行出口许可。这两题问的是许可这件世界上的事，所以是主题，role-v12 原文的例子就是 \"licensing\"。一个监管决定对一家公司收入或产品进度的影响，问成那家公司的量或产品节点时，是标的问题（同一句原文）。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-290-</ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-291-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-292-<h3>五类之外的东西去哪</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-293-<ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-294-<li><b>七类驱动不是问题类型。</b>它们是一条陈述为什么重要的理由，用来判分量和归档。D208 设计的\"每家公司种下的驱动问题\"由分析员开始覆盖时写好，不从文章里开；还没建。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-295-<li><b>别家公司自己的量</b>（对手的份额、客户的资本开支）：D187 定了\"任何公司自己的量是那家公司的问题，私营公司也算\"，但还没实现，要先在覆盖名单里加私营公司这一类。D155 定了\"公司清单可以作为初始参考，但清单外不能忽略\"。现行代码在匹配时跳过名单外的对象<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 Step 4</span>。所以抽取照常可以提这样的问题，它要过第 4 节的测试；名单外的现在会被匹配跳过，这不算抽取错。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:296:<li><b>宏观量</b>（利率、通胀）：按 D 类共同量开题<span class=\"src\">D243 第 2 条</span>。只来自一篇纯宏观文章时，只有主题在名单上才开<span class=\"src\">D191 第 3 条</span>。宏观对每家公司的正负，在判断那家公司时读主题块决定<span class=\"src\">D191 第 1 条、D195</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-297-<li><b>开题理由是封闭的</b><span class=\"src\">D184</span>：一件事属不属于五类之一，按上表逐条看，比如一个监管决定看它是不是 E 类。哪一类都不属于的不开；它是不是证据、挂到哪，照第 5 节和归档规则。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-298-</ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-299-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:300:<h3>问题怎么写：PRD 06 的梯子规则，不重写</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-301-<ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-302-<li>一个问题只问一个量的一个期间，或一件事；能各自朝相反方向走、而且分析员会分别下注的部分要分开<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 梯子第 3 条；\"分别下注\"是 D248 加的，PRD 06 签字后更新</span>，分开的每一题都要过第 4 节的测试。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-303-<li>写成问句，不写成断言<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 Rationale</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-304-<li>结果档可核对、不重叠、不留缝，到期恰好一档成立；中间一档写明和什么比；\"小幅\"\"部分\"这种不能核对的说法不用，部分状态写成单独一档<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 梯子第 2 条</span>。标的问题的档描述业务结果；主题问题的档只写结局，不写好坏<span class=\"src\">PRD 06、D186</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-305-<li>到期日：量是它的发布日；事件是能判出结果的那天。公司的量用公司财年，别的用自然年，只开今年和明年<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 梯子第 5 条；约束性义务例外，D185</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-306-</ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-307-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-308-<h2 id=\"opening\"><span class=\"num\">4</span>开题标准</h2>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-309-<blockquote><p><b>一个问题值得单独追，要同时满足三件事：它的答案可能改变仓位；能在一个日期用公开材料判出落在哪一档；库里没有问题在问同一件事。</b>开多少个是判断的结果，不是目标<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6；评审 §1</span>。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-310-<p>颗粒度按一个高端对冲基金分析员：只有会单独下注的大事开题，鸡毛蒜皮不开题（它的陈述留不留照第 5 节判）；同一个赌注的几种说法是一题，截止日、里程碑、财年和日历年各按本节\"同一题、续期，还是另一题\"里的那一条判<span class=\"src\">D248</span>。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-311-<p>另有一条前提：新问题要有独立的投资判断；一个新产品、一个新数字、一个更窄的范围，单凭这些不开<span class=\"src\">D201</span>。</p></blockquote>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-312-\n--\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-334-<tr><td>高管任免、股东投票、回购授权；章程</td><td>第 1 版 §6；章程出自 D239 选定的 role-v29 原文（\"executive appointments, shareholder votes or bylaws\"）</td><td>证据或不留</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-335-<tr><td>例行诉讼程序</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-336-<tr><td>客户的部署计划（\"它是供应商需求和产品问题的证据，除非改变供应商自己的现金或信用风险\"）</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据；改变公司自己的现金或信用风险时按 C 类判</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-337-<tr><td>以约束性义务为理由开：公司自己借钱、自己的租约、已完成或没写规模的投资。它们不是约束性义务；对别的问题仍可以是证据，或按别的开题理由判</td><td>D236、D238</td><td>证据</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-338-<tr><td>把远期年度预测改装成事件</td><td>第 1 版 §6</td><td>证据</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-339-<tr><td>后年及以后的年度量（约束性义务除外）</td><td>PRD 06 梯子第 5 条；D185</td><td>证据</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-340-<tr><td>同一个量的另一个估计、另一种口径、另一个来源</td><td>第 1 版 §6 测试 4</td><td>那个已开问题的证据，由匹配并入</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-341-</tbody></table></div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-342-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-343-<h3>同一题、续期，还是另一题：匹配这一步的事，抽取不判库里的</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-344-<ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-345-<li><b>总规则：</b>同一个结果能判掉两题，就是同一题；答案能分开走、而且分析员会分别下注的，才是另一题<span class=\"src\">D248</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:346:<li><b>同一题：</b>同一个结果能同时判两个问题。另一个估计、来源、措辞、方向<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §6 测试 4</span>；同一总量的另一种人群或代用口径（D190 碰撞裁决提示 collision-v1：\"another population or proxy of one aggregate\"；D197 引的 role-v12 原文：\"another population or another wording of the same aggregate is evidence to the shown aggregate thesis\"）。候选并进已开问题，用它的结果档和到期日<span class=\"src\">PRD 06</span>。只有以共同量理由开题、带量的候选由代码自动判，其余是匹配和碰撞裁决的判断。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-347-<li><b>同一个计划的几种说法</b>（担保、融资承诺、信用支持……），最后核对的是同一个数，是一题<span class=\"src\">D248 第 1 条</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-348-<li><b>同一件事的不同截止日：</b>早的那题开着时，晚的截止日是它的证据，不另开；早的到期没有结果、事情还在追，系统开下一个截止日的续期题，带上并进来的证据，不等新文章<span class=\"src\">D248 第 2 条</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-349-<li><b>同一代产品的几个里程碑：</b>一题，问能带来收入的那一步（通常是开始出货）；送样、发布作证据；会分别下注的里程碑（新药的三期数据和获批）各一题<span class=\"src\">D248 第 3 条</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-350-<li><b>公司自己的量：</b>只按财年开题；按日历年的估计是财年那题的证据，两种年份差得多时分量低一点<span class=\"src\">D248 第 4 条；PRD 06 梯子第 5 条</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-351-<li><b>身份：</b>事件和政策题里模型写的期间起点，不拿来挡合并；对象、事件、截止日照旧核对<span class=\"src\">D248 第 5 条</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-352-<li><b>续期：</b>同一个量或同一串事件的下一个期间<span class=\"src\">PRD 06 Succession、D190</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-353-<li><b>另一题：</b>同一件事里答案能分开走、分析员会分别下注的：有自己驱动的组成部分；同一笔交易或同一份附注里两个各自会变、分别盯着的数；另一件事<span class=\"src\">D190 碰撞裁决的四种；D248 第 1 条收窄了\"担保和融资\"</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-354-<li><b>约束性义务：</b>\"一笔或一个计划\"一题<span class=\"src\">D210</span>；一笔交易是不是某个已按金额开题的计划的一部分，由匹配判，是就并入<span class=\"src\">D248 第 1 条</span>。还没签的单笔交易是\"签不签\"的是非题，照旧可以开，不并进计划的金额题<span class=\"src\">D210；PRD 06；D248 未改</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:355:<li><b>共同量：</b>以共同量理由开题、带量的候选（量的类别是 <code>other</code> 的不算），由代码按\"主题＋量＋期间\"判同一题；政策阶段和别的事件保留按事件判的身份；不带这个开题理由的主题量由模型判<span class=\"src\">D197</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-356-</ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-357-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-358-<h3>谁判，谁查</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-359-<div class=\"table-wrap mid\"><table>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-360-<thead><tr><th>内容</th><th>谁</th></tr></thead>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-361-<tbody>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:362:<tr><td>测试 1–3、同一篇文章里的测试 4、属于哪一类、问题怎么写</td><td>抽取的模型（判断）</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-363-<tr><td>结果档形状、期间是真日期、到期在文章之后、季度数、年限、约束性义务 18 个月、<code>settled_by</code> 不为空</td><td>代码：只查形状，不判重要性<span class=\"src\">D154、D155、D184</span></td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:364:<tr><td>和库里的同一题、续期、另一题</td><td>匹配（Jev）和碰撞裁决<span class=\"src\">D190</span>；共同量由代码<span class=\"src\">D197</span></td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-365-</tbody></table></div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-366-<p class=\"note\">年限按公司财年数：2026 年 7 月时 NVIDIA 在 FY2027（2027 年 1 月结束），所以 FY2028 是明年。代码原来按自然年算，把 FY2028 当成后年拒掉；在 v29 答案的 40 个带年份的候选里拒错了 2 个。已修，测试是 <span class=\"path\">tests/test_fiscal_year_horizon.py</span><span class=\"src\">D243</span>。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-367-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-368-<h2 id=\"evidence\"><span class=\"num\">5</span>证据标准</h2>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-369-<h3>5.1 留的规则和四类</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-370-<blockquote><p><b>一个在追这家公司的分析员，读到会在本周笔记里写下来，因为它让某个问题的答案更可能或更不可能。</b>问题不限于库里已有的，也不限于本公司：客户、供应商、竞争者、监管、宏观都算<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §2；D208 七类驱动</span>。</p></blockquote>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-371-<p><b>整体倾向谨慎，对增量敏感。</b>杂音很大，不是什么都要抽，不是什么都算线索。判一句话之前先问：这是新信息吗？它让哪个问题的答案变了？一件新发生的事、一个新数字、一个新的具体判断，是增量，不能漏；重复常识、描述长期状况、泛泛的看法，是杂音<span class=\"src\">D243</span>。增量和杂音的具体界线按 5.3 各行和边界一起判<span class=\"src\">D250</span>。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-372-<p>从第一段读到最后一段，分析员会记的（按本节和 5.3 各行边界一起判）都留。一页有八条就是八条，不挑<span class=\"src\">D199</span>。它们通常是下面四类之一；四类描述的是会记的陈述长什么样，不是\"属于四类就一定留\"，留不留由上面的规则判；具体不留的行和边界见 5.3。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-373-<ol class=\"steps\">\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-374-<li><b>公司自己的数字、指引或决定</b><span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §2</span>\"同店销售本季增长 4.2%\"；\"管理层把全年收入指引定在 120–130 亿美元\"；\"董事会批准 100 亿美元回购\"；\"公司取消软件订阅费，生产使用免费\"<span class=\"src\">Alex 判 8，Omniverse</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-375-<li><b>客户、供应商、竞争者、伙伴的有规模、有日期或有名字的动作，以及它们公布的数字</b><span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §2：三者有一个就够</span>第 1 版的例子\"Google Cloud 季度收入 248 亿美元，增长 82%，积压超过 5000 亿美元\"<span class=\"src\">Alex 判 11</span>；\"最大客户说明年订单砍五分之一\"；\"主要供应商说 2027 年产能翻倍\"；\"对手在欧洲降价 15%\"；\"一家银行选用竞争对手的系统\"；\"一家软件公司把本公司的模型集成进政府系统\"。后两条有名字、没金额，也留<span class=\"src\">D240</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-376-<li><b>具名一方的主张或估计</b><span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §2</span>\"CFO 说十年前建的工厂仍满负荷\"；\"分析师把明年 EPS 预期上调到 4.10 美元\"；\"做空机构指控公司虚增应收 20 亿美元\"；\"内存厂说 2027 年短缺最严重，持续到 2030\"。</li>\n--\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-573-<li><b>记一行</b>假设、改动、数字（回归先报）、留不留；没用的改动和自己的错也记<span class=\"src\">AGENTS §7</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-574-<li><b>一批改完再验收</b>在最终配置上三次发送，按 9.2 由不是作者的读者评，结果给 Alex<span class=\"src\">第 1 版 §11</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-575-</ol>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-576-<p class=\"note warn\"><b>尺子有疑问就停。</b>改的时候发现金标和这一页说法不同、两份标准打架、或读者对\"什么是对的\"有分歧，就停下来先和 Alex 定尺子，不在有疑问的尺子上接着调<span class=\"src\">D241；AGENTS §7</span>。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-577-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-578-<h2 id=\"rulings\"><span class=\"num\">10</span>Alex 已经拍过的判例</h2>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-579-<p>第 1 版 §8 的全部，加之后的。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-580-<div class=\"table-wrap wide\"><table>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-581-<thead><tr><th>日期</th><th>判例</th><th>原话或答案</th></tr></thead>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-582-<tbody>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-583-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-22</td><td class=\"nowrap\">讲话方式</td><td>\"explain and answer like I'm 16 and in human understandable language\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-584-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">AGENTS §8</td><td class=\"nowrap\">观点是什么</td><td>A thesis is an argued view about the business and the world; its stance comes from the argument weighed against what is priced. Financial-statement lines are its evidence, never its definition.</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:585:<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-26 D191</td><td class=\"nowrap\">共同量、主题</td><td>决定文字：\"<code>industry_aggregate</code> is renamed <code>shared_quantity</code>: a quantity or price outside any one company that several move on\"，Alex：\"好\"；纯宏观文章只在主题在名单上时开，Alex：\"是\"；主题对公司一对全部，Alex：\"我觉得这个 1 to all mapping 比较 make sense\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-586-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-26 D187</td><td class=\"nowrap\">别家公司的量</td><td>选 C（\"可以\"）：任何公司自己的量是那家公司的问题，私营公司也算；记录，未实现</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-587-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-27</td><td class=\"nowrap\">这一步的标准</td><td>\"做一个 hedge fund analyst 的专业视角去看怎么做这一步的标准\"；\"什么叫重要陈述，你也没给例子\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-588-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-28 D208</td><td class=\"nowrap\">驱动层</td><td>\"可以，但是不能因为有了这层我们的抽取就是非常的模版化缺少了hedge fund analyst 的灵魂\"；宏观\"算是个global factor to all, 但影响正反面不一定\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-589-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-28 D209</td><td class=\"nowrap\">没家的陈述</td><td>\"if it doesn't matter, just fucking throw it away … if there are false positives that got thrown away … you got to pick it up. Again, that's the way to do proper evaluation.\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-590-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-28</td><td class=\"nowrap\">不许前视</td><td>\"不是你这么粗暴的把这些都先写好那岂不是lookahead了\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-591-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-28</td><td class=\"nowrap\">逐条读</td><td>\"有用的，你得一条一条看是不是真的值得抽才知道你这些改动的抽取效果\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-592-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D215</td><td class=\"nowrap\">十一题</td><td>1 A（收入增速 核心）；2 C→D216 \"2028 EPS 预测可以留下来啊，我的意思是因为太久远了，现在才2026\"；3 A（内存短缺 核心）；4 B（AMD 跑分 辅助）；5 C（新加坡案件 不留，D231 改为可选）；6 B（三条政策 辅助）；7 A（云厂商支出 核心）；8 B（Omniverse 辅助）；9 \"辅助属于供给需求\"（Sharon）；10 \"属于产品进度问题\"（NVL72x2）；11 \"一条吧都属于财务\"（Google Cloud 三个数一条）</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-593-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D218</td><td class=\"nowrap\">推断</td><td>\"是推断，你不要再问我了，你要自己尝试 figure out 开始跑\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-594-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D220</td><td class=\"nowrap\">谁定标准</td><td>\"你来修正对齐，你是 hedge fund analyst 你来做好标准\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-595-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D217</td><td class=\"nowrap\">目标模型</td><td>\"现在开始以haiku 为模型取代luna … 每一轮都根据尺子去迭代 … 小心 overfit … 尺子其实不对 … scope creep\"（D234 起 Haiku 暂停）</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-596-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D226、D228</td><td class=\"nowrap\">评法</td><td>合理的模糊和不同措辞可以接受；金标例子教的是判断逻辑，不是唯一答案；两套既有标准（证据层次、90 题评审）都要用；来源、用途、准入分开判</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-597-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29</td><td class=\"nowrap\">今天</td><td>\"之前没有对齐一个hedge fund analyst 应该要用什么标准来抽研究观点\"</td></tr>\n--\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-604-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D240</td><td class=\"nowrap\">不完整的证据</td><td>\"我不是和你说过不要这么死板吗？这个证据显然是有意义的，不一定什么条件数据时间都要满足，你应该把它记录下来，只是可能档位低一点\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-605-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D241</td><td class=\"nowrap\">这份标准</td><td>\"几个大类型的账本 - 开题标准和档次 这两个要完整的定义好写好\"；\"档位根据信息量作定标 -以上有你自己trace 过的golden set 来做为改prompt测试标准\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-606-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D243</td><td class=\"nowrap\">签字</td><td>第 5 条：\"这种典型的主张背景属于常识，基本上抽出来也没有太多的意义除非带数字和具体的叙事不然都是属于不采纳\"；方向：\"不是什么事情都是惊弓之鸟需要抽取，杂音还是很大的，我们整体应该倾向谨慎不要看什么都是线索的感觉，但是同时我们要敏感一些新的信息带来的增量不要错过\"；\"其他几条的意见我都ok，sign off\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-607-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-29 D242</td><td class=\"nowrap\">这一页</td><td>\"你给我一个网页，这个同时也是你这个环节重要的PRD\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-608-<tr><td class=\"nowrap\">10-30 D248</td><td class=\"nowrap\">颗粒度</td><td>七条各选 A（第 6 条\"A， A\"）；原则：\"我觉得核心就是这个颗粒度的把控要符合一个高端的hedge fund analyst 的思维。不要搜集一堆鸡毛蒜皮的事情，要看重要的大事，合并整合关键的信息，这个是这个步骤的原则\"</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-609-</tbody></table></div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-610-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-611-<h2 id=\"conflicts\"><span class=\"num\">11</span>在用的标准之间的冲突，怎么摆平</h2>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-612-<p>编号对应盘点报告 <span class=\"path\">inventory-2026-10-29.md</span> 的 B1–B20，B21 是后来加的。\"按已拍的\"是已有决定，只是没落实或没写全；文首 12 条的决定记在 D243；\"我定\"只限措辞和记录约定。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-613-<div class=\"table-wrap wide\"><table>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-614-<thead><tr><th>#</th><th>冲突</th><th>处理</th><th>依据</th></tr></thead>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-615-<tbody>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:616:<tr><td>B1</td><td>共同量的名字和定义：D191 改名并扩到价格；v16 起提示词和代码用 <code>industry_aggregate</code>、几家公司合计、一个日历年</td><td>按 D191 落实为 <code>shared_quantity</code>，期间仍用自然年；提示词和代码要跟着改</td><td>D191、D243；PRD 06</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-617-<tr><td>B2</td><td>主驱动量含不含产品节点</td><td>含，写成 A、B 两类</td><td>D236（在 D184 之后）</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-618-<tr><td>B3</td><td>约束性义务：一笔或一个计划一题（D210），还是一组入股是一个判断（D201 规则 G）</td><td>按 D210 \"一笔或一个计划\"；一笔交易属不属于已开的计划，由匹配判；同一计划的几种说法是一题；够不上公司规模的单笔交易不开题，陈述留不留照第 5 节判</td><td>D210、D236、D238、D248</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-619-<tr><td>B4</td><td>开题测试三套，提示词和代码都没用</td><td>第 1 版 §6 四个测试加评审三条写法检查（第 4 节）；测试 4 和库比的部分归匹配</td><td>第 1 版 §6；评审 §1；D211</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-620-<tr><td>B5</td><td>PRD 05 还写着 <code>folds_into</code>、第 5 块</td><td>抽取不看库；PRD 05 过时段落签字后改指这一页</td><td>D211</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-621-<tr><td>B6</td><td>没家的证据扔不扔</td><td>产品里扔，评估读被扔的、分四种归因；两者不冲突</td><td>D209；第 1 版 §7</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-622-<tr><td>B7</td><td>归档规则三个版本</td><td>以 D207 为准；归档提示里点名 NVIDIA 的那句按 D237 改成通用（后续一步）</td><td>D207、D237</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-623-<tr><td>B8</td><td>分量几级、\"档位\"一词两义</td><td>四级；\"档位\"在这一页叫分量，问题的叫结果档</td><td>第 1 版 §10.3；D243 第 1 条</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-624-<tr><td>B9</td><td>几套\"不要\"的类</td><td>抽取只有一套：按 5.3 各行及其边界判，判为不收的分量是\"不收\"；\"不可用\"属于判断这一步（第 7 节）；\"无关陈述\"用定稿金标计数</td><td>第 1 版 §2、§4；D221；D240；D243 第 12 条</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-625-<tr><td>B10</td><td>股价、目标价、重述、新加坡各处判得不同</td><td>财报后股价反应可选（第 1 版 §10.2）；在研公司的估值倍数、市值、孤零零的目标价可选；重提的过去实际数可选；新加坡可选</td><td>第 1 版 §10.2；D231；D243 第 4、6 条</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:626:<tr><td>B11</td><td>主题怎么连到公司</td><td>一对全部的主题块；文章明写的依赖照记；D208 的通道未建</td><td>D191、D195</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-627-<tr><td>B12</td><td>研究组、驱动层</td><td>研究组不是问题，不代替开题判断；七类驱动是重要性的理由；词汇表只禁 \"thesis driver\"</td><td>D165、D208；评审 §6</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-628-<tr><td>B13</td><td>PRD 06 的重复和替代说法早于 D202、D204</td><td>这一页按 D202、D204 写（第 2 节、5.5）；PRD 06 签字后更新</td><td>D202、D204</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-629-<tr><td>B14</td><td>组成部分算不算同一题</td><td>同一总量的另一种人群或口径是同一题；有自己驱动、答案能分开走、分析员会分别下注的是另一题，要过独立意义测试</td><td>D190；第 1 版 §6；D248</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-630-<tr><td>B15</td><td>标的五档必须叫\"非常看多……\"（代码），还是写业务结果（D186）</td><td>这一页按 D186 写；代码是另一模块，D186 未实现照旧记</td><td>D186</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-631-<tr><td>B16</td><td>转述的公告算事实还是当事人陈述</td><td>事实（role-v29 原文：\"an announcement or completed deal the item reports is a fact even when the reporter names no source\"）；混合的一条按主要说法定层</td><td>PRD 06；D238、D239；D243 第 9 条</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-632-<tr><td>B17</td><td>代码按自然年拒公司明年的财年量</td><td>已修：年限按公司财年数，测试 <span class=\"path\">tests/test_fiscal_year_horizon.py</span></td><td>PRD 06 梯子第 5 条；D243</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-633-<tr><td>B18</td><td>\"线索\"\"背景\"一词多义</td><td>\"线索\"只指研究用途的一级（第 7 节）；\"背景\"只指 5.3 那一行</td><td>D221</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:634:<tr><td>B19</td><td>谁把候选并进已开问题</td><td>匹配和碰撞裁决；共同量由代码</td><td>D190、D197、D211</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-635-<tr><td>B20</td><td>AGENTS §8 指向两套标准，D229 又说第 1 版是唯一尺子</td><td>这一页签字后取代第 1 版，AGENTS §8 指向这一页；对两套既有标准（PRD 06 证据层次、90 题评审）的指向保留，它们是这一页的出处</td><td>D228、D229、D243</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-636-<tr><td>B21</td><td>PRD 06 State 写判断要 \"reconsider all evidence still in force\"，D198 之后只显示新到的和依据</td><td>按 D198（在后）；PRD 06 签字后更新</td><td>D198</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-637-</tbody></table></div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-638-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-639-<h2 id=\"checks\"><span class=\"num\">12</span>校验记录和出处</h2>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-640-<h3>三轮独立读者仿真</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-641-<p>每一轮把标准和一组事先定死的案例交给互相看不到答案的读者：作者先写好自己的答案并记 sha256；Claude 的不同模型和 Codex 各读一份。读者只读标准和案例，不读决策、金标、提示词。几方不一致的案例，读原因，追到标准里的一句话，改那一句；下一轮换没见过的读者，加没见过的案例。共 192 个陈述、40 个问题；陈述里 152 个来自测试文章，40 个来自银行、药企、零售、航空、公用事业、矿业、保险等其他行业。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-642-<div class=\"table-wrap mid\"><table>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-643-<thead><tr><th>第三轮，一对读者</th><th class=\"num-cell\">新案例：留不留</th><th class=\"num-cell\">新案例：连分量</th><th class=\"num-cell\">难案例复核：留不留</th><th class=\"num-cell\">新问题</th></tr></thead>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-644-<tbody>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-645-<tr><td>作者–Codex</td><td class=\"num-cell\">96%</td><td class=\"num-cell\">87%</td><td class=\"num-cell\">84%</td><td class=\"num-cell\">5/8</td></tr>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-646-<tr><td>作者–Claude sonnet</td><td class=\"num-cell\">94%</td><td class=\"num-cell\">83%</td><td class=\"num-cell\">91%</td><td class=\"num-cell\">6/8</td></tr>\n--\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-665-<rect class=\"bar\" x=\"266\" y=\"145.5\" width=\"34\" height=\"24.5\"/><text class=\"val\" x=\"283\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"283\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.8</text>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-666-<rect class=\"bar\" x=\"312\" y=\"145.5\" width=\"34\" height=\"24.5\"/><text class=\"val\" x=\"329\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"329\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.9</text>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-667-<rect class=\"bar\" x=\"358\" y=\"149\" width=\"34\" height=\"21\"/><text class=\"val\" x=\"375\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"375\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.10</text>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-668-<rect class=\"bar\" x=\"404\" y=\"152.5\" width=\"34\" height=\"17.5\"/><text class=\"val\" x=\"421\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"421\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.11</text>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-669-<rect class=\"bar\" x=\"450\" y=\"149\" width=\"34\" height=\"21\"/><text class=\"val\" x=\"467\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"467\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.12</text>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-670-<rect class=\"bar\" x=\"496\" y=\"152.5\" width=\"34\" height=\"17.5\"/><text class=\"val\" x=\"513\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"513\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.13</text>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-671-</g>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-672-<text x=\"290\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"middle\">被检查的版本；颜色浅的两根是约数</text>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-673-</svg>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-674-</div>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-675-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-676-<h3>出处</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:677:<p>PRD 06（Two thesis kinds、Ladder、Four evidence tiers、State、Succession）；PRD 05；第 1 版标准（D229）；<span class=\"path\">research_notes/对冲基金论点粒度与金标/codex-challenger.md</span> §1 八条和 §6、<span class=\"path\">industry-debate-standards.md</span>（主分支）；决定 D155、D165、D184、D185、D186、D187、D190、D191、D195、D197、D198、D199、D201、D202、D204、D207、D208、D209、D210、D211、D215、D216、D218、D220、D221、D226、D228、D229、D231、D233、D236、D237、D238、D240、D241、D242。</p>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-678-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-679-<h3>文件</h3>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-680-<ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-681-<li>这一页：<span class=\"path\">docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html</span>。改它之前先在 <span class=\"path\">docs/DECISIONS.md</span> 记下 Alex 的原话；改完跑一次只读的漂移检查。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-682-<li>起草过程和证据：<span class=\"path\">docs/research/2026-10-29-ledger-standard/</span>：<span class=\"path\">standard-v2.md</span> 到 <span class=\"path\">standard-v2.14.md</span>、<span class=\"path\">simulation-log.md</span>、<span class=\"path\">review-drift-v2.*.md</span>、<span class=\"path\">inventory-2026-10-29.md</span>、<span class=\"path\">golden-v3/</span>。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-683-<li>定稿金标：<span class=\"path\">golden-v3/golden-v3-signed.json</span>（sha256 见第 8 节），由 <span class=\"path\">golden-v3/finalize.py</span> 从起草稿定稿。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-684-<li>第 1 版：<span class=\"path\">docs/research/2026-10-29-analyst-standard/standard.md</span>（D229），已由这一页取代，留作出处。</li>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-685-</ul>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-686-\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-687-<footer>Hivemind · 抽取与开题标准 · 第 5 版 · 2026-10-29 Alex 签字（D243），2026-10-30 按 Alex 逐个选的七条修订（D248），2026-10-31 按 Alex 定的证据四条界线和计数单位修订（D250）。页首的 standard-version 是规则的版本号：改任何一条规则都要升它，金标随之重定，打分程序遇到版本对不上就拒绝打分（D244）。</footer>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-688-</main>\ndocs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html-689-</div>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
